window.CARDS=window.CARDS||{};CARDS["people-kouenji-rokusuke"]=[{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p20-1","v":"y1v1","y":1,"o":1,"k":"action spoken","w":"kushida-kikyou kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke bus priority seat debate  absolute egoism crowded bus on entrance morning  koenji sits with his legs crossed in the designated priority seating  well built athletic frame  blond hair  dressed in the anhs uniform  ignores the wobbling elderly woman standing near him  when kushida approaches and politely asks him to give up his seat  he smirks and rebuffs her without shifting an inch   why should i offer up my seat  there s no reason for me to do so   i don t understand  priority seats are just that  priority seats  i have no legal obligation to move  since i m currently occupying this seat  i should be the one who determines whether or not i move  am i supposed to give up my seat just because i m young  ha  that reasoning is nonsense  flashes a pointlessly vigorous smile  slides his earphones in  and begins listening to cacophonous music  his smug  self important attitude remains fixed as the office lady clenches her teeth   a contribution to society  you say  well  that is a rather interesting opinion  it s certainly true that offering up one s seat to the elderly could be viewed in such a positive light  unfortunately  i have no interest in contributing to society  i care only for my own satisfaction  oh  and one more thing  you re asking me  the one in the priority seat  to give up his spot  but couldn t you simply ask one of the other people seated on this crowded bus  if you truly cared for the elderly  then something like priority seating would be a rather trivial concern  wouldn t you agree  flawless aristocratic arrogance  unshakeable rationalized selfishness  completely immune to public shaming  peer pressure  or conventional morality  sharp philosophical debater who exposes the hypocrisy of the crowd  theatrical  high handed  grandiloquent aristocratic rhetoric  complete dismissal of her moral appeal","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p20-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Bus priority seat debate: absolute egoism<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V1 · p.20–22<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Crowded bus on entrance morning. Kōenji sits with his legs crossed in the designated priority seating. Well-built athletic frame, blond hair, dressed in the ANHS uniform.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Why should I offer up my seat? There’s no reason for me to do so.”<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I don’t understand. Priority seats are just that: priority seats. I have no legal obligation to move. Since I’m currently occupying this seat, I should be the one who determines whether or not I move. Am I supposed to give up my…”<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“A contribution to society, you say? Well, that is a rather interesting opinion. It’s certainly true that offering up one’s seat to the elderly could be viewed in such a positive light. Unfortunately, I have no interest in…”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Ignores the wobbling elderly woman standing near him. When Kushida approaches and politely asks him to give up his seat, he smirks and rebuffs her without shifting an inch.<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don’t understand. Priority seats are just that: priority seats. I have no legal obligation to move. Since I’m currently occupying this seat, I should be the one who determines whether or not I move. Am I supposed to give up my seat just because I’m young? Ha! That reasoning is nonsense.”<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Flashes a pointlessly vigorous smile, slides his earphones in, and begins listening to cacophonous music; his smug, self-important attitude remains fixed as the office lady clenches her teeth.<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “A contribution to society, you say? Well, that is a rather interesting opinion. It’s certainly true that offering up one’s seat to the elderly could be viewed in such a positive light. Unfortunately, I have no interest in contributing to society. I care only for my own satisfaction. Oh, and one more thing. You’re asking me, the one in the priority seat, to give up his spot, but couldn’t you simply ask one of the other people seated on this crowded bus? If you truly cared for the elderly, then something like priority seating would be a rather trivial concern, wouldn’t you agree?”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Flawless aristocratic arrogance, unshakeable rationalized selfishness, completely immune to public shaming, peer pressure, or conventional morality; sharp philosophical debater who exposes the hypocrisy of the crowd.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Voice<\/span> Theatrical, high-handed, grandiloquent aristocratic rhetoric.<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> Complete dismissal of her moral appeal.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p38-1\">→ After: Classroom Day 1: the Conglomerate Heir<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p38-1","v":"y1v1","y":1,"o":1,"k":"action spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke classroom day 1  the conglomerate heir class 1 d classroom during hirata s introductions  inspecting his reflection and bangs in a personal hand mirror  combing his hair while classmates speak   hmph  fine  throws both legs up onto his desk  leaning back arrogantly before addressing the room   my name is kouenji rokusuke  as the sole male heir to the kouenji conglomerate group  i will soon be tasked with carrying japan into the future  i sincerely look forward to making your acquaintance  ladies   starting today  i will mercilessly punish anyone who makes me uncomfortable  please exercise proper precaution so that you may avoid that   i meant exactly what i said  if asked to give an example  well  i would say i hate ugly things  for instance  so  if i saw something ugly  i would do just as i said  flips his long bangs dramatically  fwish  megalomaniacal self obsession  views himself as supreme  addresses only women  openly threatens anyone who offends his aesthetic sensibilities  treats hirata s attempts at orderly mediation as mere amusing background noise","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p38-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Classroom Day 1: the Conglomerate Heir<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V1 · p.38–39<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Class 1-D classroom during Hirata&#x27;s introductions.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hmph. Fine.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“My name is Kouenji Rokusuke. As the sole male heir to the Kouenji conglomerate group, I will soon be tasked with carrying Japan into the future. I sincerely look forward to making your acquaintance, ladies.”<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Starting today, I will mercilessly punish anyone who makes me uncomfortable. Please exercise proper precaution so that you may avoid that.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Inspecting his reflection and bangs in a personal hand mirror, combing his hair while classmates speak.<span class=\"pg\">p.38<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Throws both legs up onto his desk, leaning back arrogantly before addressing the room.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I meant exactly what I said. If asked to give an example, well… I would say I hate ugly things, for instance. So, if I saw something ugly, I would do just as I said.”<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Flips his long bangs dramatically (*fwish!*).<span class=\"pg\">p.39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Megalomaniacal self-obsession; views himself as supreme; addresses only women; openly threatens anyone who offends his aesthetic sensibilities.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Treats Hirata&#x27;s attempts at orderly mediation as mere amusing background noise.<span class=\"pg\">p.38–39<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p20-1\">← Before: Bus priority seat debate: absolute egoism<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p86-1\">→ After: Pool class: the 23.22-second swim feat<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p86-1","v":"y1v1","y":1,"o":1,"k":"action spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke pool class  the 23 22 second swim feat campus indoor heated swimming pool  co ed physical education class  walks to the starting block wearing tight black speedo briefs  completely unconcerned as classmates stare and girls look away  takes an athlete s flawless starting stance on the block  physical conditioning  possesses an extraordinarily sculpted  muscular physique clearly superior to varsity athlete sudo ken  dives into the pool with textbook perfection  swims with explosive speed and aggressive form  clocked at  23 22 seconds  in the 50m sprint  the pe instructor looks at his stopwatch twice in stunned disbelief  climbs out of the pool completely unbothered  showing zero shortness of breath as if he hadn t exerted himself at all  smirks and sweeps his wet hair back   my abdominal muscles  back muscles  and psoas major muscle seem to be in good shape  as usual  not a bad performance  races sudo in the final heat  crushes sudo by a massive 5 meter lead with effortless ease  elite athletic capability coupled with clinical anatomical self awareness  views peak physical performance as natural entitlement","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p86-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Pool class: the 23.22-second swim feat<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V1 · p.86–88<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Campus indoor heated swimming pool. Co-ed physical education class.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“My abdominal muscles, back muscles, and psoas major muscle seem to be in good shape, as usual. Not a bad performance.”<span class=\"pg\">p.87<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Walks to the starting block wearing tight black speedo briefs, completely unconcerned as classmates stare and girls look away. Takes an athlete&#x27;s flawless starting stance on the block.<span class=\"pg\">p.86–87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Physical conditioning: possesses an extraordinarily sculpted, muscular physique clearly superior to varsity athlete Sudō Ken.<span class=\"pg\">p.87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Dives into the pool with textbook perfection; swims with explosive speed and aggressive form.<span class=\"pg\">p.87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Clocked at **23.22 seconds** in the 50m sprint. The PE instructor looks at his stopwatch twice in stunned disbelief.<span class=\"pg\">p.87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Climbs out of the pool completely unbothered, showing zero shortness of breath as if he hadn&#x27;t exerted himself at all. Smirks and sweeps his wet hair back.<span class=\"pg\">p.87<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Races Sudō in the final heat; crushes Sudō by a massive 5-meter lead with effortless ease.<span class=\"pg\">p.88<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Elite athletic capability coupled with clinical anatomical self-awareness; views peak physical performance as natural entitlement.<span class=\"pg\">p.87<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p38-1\">← Before: Classroom Day 1: the Conglomerate Heir<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p121-1\">→ After: Deducing zero points &amp; supreme corporate indifference<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p121-1","v":"y1v1","y":1,"o":1,"k":"action spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke deducing zero points   supreme corporate indifference classroom 1 d  may 1st morning homeroom  props his feet up on his desk  laughs boisterously  and points smugly toward hondou and chabashira   ha ha ha  i see  so  it s like that then  teacher  i think i ve solved the mystery  it s simple  we re in class d  so we didn t receive a single point  chuckles boldly and counters hondou s claim about 100 000 points every month   i don t remember hearing that  though  do you  instant analytical deduction  decodes the s system s harsh reality and deduces class d s zero point allocation before anyone else in the room  scoffs in amusement when yukimura panics over losing guaranteed university and career placement   besides  i don t care in the slightest if the school does or doesn t assist me to higher education or the workforce  it s been decided that i will lead the kouenji conglomerate group  whether i m in class d or class a is a trivial matter  absolute socioeconomic safety  sole heir to the kouenji conglomerate group  his career and life trajectory are completely pre determined regardless of graduation status  razor sharp intellect masked behind flamboyant vanity  impervious to institutional pressure because he operates outside ordinary societal incentives","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p121-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Deducing zero points &amp; supreme corporate indifference<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V1 · p.121, 130<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Classroom 1-D, May 1st morning homeroom.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ha ha ha! I see. So, it’s like that then, teacher? I think I’ve solved the mystery… It’s simple. We’re in Class D, so we didn’t receive a single point.”<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I don’t remember hearing that, though. Do you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Besides, I don’t care in the slightest if the school does or doesn’t assist me to higher education or the workforce. It’s been decided that I will lead the Kouenji conglomerate group. Whether I’m in Class D or Class A is a…”<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Props his feet up on his desk, laughs boisterously, and points smugly toward Hondou and Chabashira.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Chuckles boldly and counters Hondou’s claim about 100,000 points every month.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Instant analytical deduction: decodes the S-System&#x27;s harsh reality and deduces Class D&#x27;s zero-point allocation before anyone else in the room.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Scoffs in amusement when Yukimura panics over losing guaranteed university and career placement.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Besides, I don’t care in the slightest if the school does or doesn’t assist me to higher education or the workforce. It’s been decided that I will lead the Kouenji conglomerate group. Whether I’m in Class D or Class A is a trivial matter.”<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> Absolute socioeconomic safety: sole heir to the Kouenji Conglomerate Group; his career and life trajectory are completely pre-determined regardless of graduation status.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Razor-sharp intellect masked behind flamboyant vanity; impervious to institutional pressure because he operates outside ordinary societal incentives.<span class=\"pg\">p.121, 130<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p86-1\">← Before: Pool class: the 23.22-second swim feat<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p214-1\">→ After: Palate Café harem<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p214-1","v":"y1v1","y":1,"o":1,"k":"action spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke palate cafe harem palate cafe  keyaki mall  lunchtime  revealed as a daily palate regular  holds court at a back table surrounded by girls   all third years   who feed him and dote on him  ayanokoji has never seen him at lunch elsewhere   ha ha  just as i thought  more mature girls are the best   to a third year feeding him   here  kouenji kun  say  ahh  his name is  going around lately  campus wide  kushida notes even the third years are talking about him  ayanokoji s read  they re after his money  effortless cross year social dominance  total unshyness  monetized charisma   popularity that predates any class rank signal","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p214-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Palate Café harem<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V1 · p.214<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Palate Café, Keyaki Mall, lunchtime.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ha ha! Just as I thought, more mature girls are the best.” (to a third-year feeding him: &quot;Here, Kouenji-kun, say &#x27;Ahh!&#x27;&quot;)<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Revealed as a daily Palate regular: holds court at a back table surrounded by girls — all third-years — who feed him and dote on him; Ayanokōji has never seen him at lunch elsewhere.<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> His name is &quot;going around lately&quot; campus-wide; Kushida notes even the third-years are talking about him (Ayanokōji&#x27;s read: they&#x27;re after his money).<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Effortless cross-year social dominance; total unshyness; monetized charisma — popularity that predates any class-rank signal.<span class=\"pg\">p.214<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v1-p121-1\">← Before: Deducing zero points &amp; supreme corporate indifference<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p20-1","v":"y1v2","y":1,"o":2,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2 sec  2 2  lunch  the balance that bought him out of the cafeteria lunch in the class d room  horikita  ayanokoji and koenji are the students still at their desks while the rest have gone to eat    a few students were still all alone  ak s account of how his social calendar changed   on first starting here  he d enjoyed the company of girls from other classes and grade levels  however  once he ran low on points  he began to spend most of his time in the classroom   he was currently completely lost in examining his face in a hand mirror  his daily routine  ak s correction of the usual reading of him   he didn t love solitude  but rather  loved himself and cared little for others  i respected that he didn t seem bothered at all by being alone   he was the sole heir to the kouenji conglomerate group  one of the largest corporations in japan    ak repeats the fact here as background for why koenji is unbothered  his own dismissal of class rank belongs to volume 1 and is recorded there  what he eats  and whether he buys anything at all in july  is never stated  the text here says only that he has stopped leaving the classroom to be entertained","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p20-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.2 (lunch): the balance that bought him out of the cafeteria<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V2 · p.20<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Lunch in the Class D room: Horikita, Ayanokōji and Kōenji are the students still at their desks while the rest have gone to eat — &quot;a few students were still all alone&quot;. &quot;He was currently completely lost in examining his face in a hand mirror, his daily routine.&quot;<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> AK&#x27;s account of how his social calendar changed: &quot;On first starting here, he’d enjoyed the company of girls from other classes and grade levels. However, once he ran low on points, he began to spend most of his time in the classroom.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> AK&#x27;s correction of the usual reading of him: &quot;He didn’t love solitude, but rather, loved himself and cared little for others. I respected that he didn’t seem bothered at all by being alone.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> &quot;He was the sole heir to the Kouenji conglomerate group, one of the largest corporations in Japan.&quot; — AK repeats the fact here as background for why Kōenji is unbothered; his own dismissal of class rank belongs to Volume 1 and is recorded there.<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> What he eats, and whether he buys anything at all in July, is never stated; the text here says only that he has stopped leaving the classroom to be entertained.<span class=\"pg\">p.20<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p92-1\">→ After: Ch.4 sec. 4.3: he speaks to Sudou&#x27;s face without looking at him<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p92-1","v":"y1v2","y":1,"o":2,"k":"spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4 sec  4 3  he speaks to sudou s face without looking at him his intervention is announced by the mirror  not the man   the voice came from a boy checking his reflection in a hand mirror to fix his hair  it was kouenji rokusuke  an especially odd guy even amongst the remarkably strange people of our class   don t you think it would ve been better if you d been expelled  your existence is far from beautiful  no  in fact  i could say your life is an ugly one  red hair kun    he nicknames sudou by his hair  the same detail the class s witness used for him  ak on the delivery   kouenji didn t even look at sudou as he spoke  it was as if this were a soliloquy   it would be inefficient for me to tell you  no matter how many times i did  if i know that you re dim witted  then it doesn t matter how many times i try to lecture you  does it   puh  i don t think i ve experienced being wrong since i was born  you must be mistaken    to hirata  the one classmate who tells him he is in the wrong   unfortunately  i ve never experienced being wrong  not once in my entire life  oh  looks like it s about time for my date  well  if you ll excuse me    he leaves mid argument on a scheduled date  no date is ever shown  what his two sentences cost  a desk is kicked apart  sudou walks on him  and the class s last organised effort to save anyone collapses into hirata physically holding sudou back  he is the only student in the volume who treats expulsion as a preference rather than a threat  and he says it to the one student whose expulsion risk he cannot lose anything from","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p92-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 sec. 4.3: he speaks to Sudou&#x27;s face without looking at him<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V2 · p.92–93<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">His intervention is announced by the mirror, not the man: &quot;The voice came from a boy checking his reflection in a hand mirror to fix his hair. It was Kouenji Rokusuke, an especially odd guy even amongst the remarkably strange people of our class.&quot; AK on the delivery: &quot;Kouenji didn’t even look at Sudou as he spoke. It was as if this were a soliloquy.&quot;<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Don’t you think it would’ve been better if you’d been expelled? Your existence is far from beautiful. No, in fact, I could say your life is an ugly one, Red Hair-kun.” — he nicknames Sudou by his hair, the same detail the…”<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It would be inefficient for me to tell you, no matter how many times I did. If I know that you’re dim-witted, then it doesn’t matter how many times I try to lecture you, does it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Puh. I don’t think I’ve experienced being wrong since I was born. You must be mistaken.” — to Hirata, the one classmate who tells him he is in the wrong.<span class=\"pg\">p.93<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Don’t you think it would’ve been better if you’d been expelled? Your existence is far from beautiful. No, in fact, I could say your life is an ugly one, Red Hair-kun.” — he nicknames Sudou by his hair, the same detail the class&#x27;s witness used for him.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Unfortunately, I’ve never experienced being wrong. Not once in my entire life. Oh, looks like it’s about time for my date. Well, if you’ll excuse me.” — he leaves mid-argument on a scheduled date; no date is ever shown.<span class=\"pg\">p.93<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> What his two sentences cost: a desk is kicked apart, Sudou walks on him, and the class&#x27;s last organised effort to save anyone collapses into Hirata physically holding Sudou back.<span class=\"pg\">p.92<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> He is the only student in the volume who treats expulsion as a preference rather than a threat, and he says it to the one student whose expulsion risk he cannot lose anything from.<span class=\"pg\">p.92–93<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p20-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.2 (lunch): the balance that bought him out of the cafeteria<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p119-1\">→ After: Ch.4 sec. 4.6, sec. 4.8: he exists in the rest of the chapter as other people&#x27;s summary<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p119-1","v":"y1v2","y":1,"o":2,"k":"spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4 sec  4 6  sec  4 8  he exists in the rest of the chapter as other people s summary in the narrator s private list of students who were wrongly sorted into class d   horikita  kouenji  and yukimura were undoubtedly three people who deserved to be at the top based on their academics alone  kushida  reopening the corridor incident on the phone   that reminds me  it was really scary when kouenji kun and sudoukun looked like they were about to start fighting    printed as one word  kept as the translation has it  in ayanokoji s estimate of what that fight would have become   kouenji always seemed laid back  but if sudou started taking swings at him  he would fight  if that happened  it d be a disaster  he has no scene of his own after p 93  the second half of chapter 4 keeps him as a recollection and a hypothesis","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p119-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 sec. 4.6, sec. 4.8: he exists in the rest of the chapter as other people&#x27;s summary<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V2 · p.119, p.129<\/span><\/h3><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">Kushida, reopening the corridor incident on the phone: &quot;That reminds me. It was really scary when Kouenji-kun and Sudoukun looked like they were about to start fighting.&quot; — printed as one word; kept as the translation has it.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> In the narrator&#x27;s private list of students who were wrongly sorted into Class D: &quot;Horikita, Kouenji, and Yukimura were undoubtedly three people who deserved to be at the top based on their academics alone.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> In Ayanokōji&#x27;s estimate of what that fight would have become: &quot;Kouenji always seemed laid-back, but if Sudou started taking swings at him, he would fight. If that happened, it’d be a disaster.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> He has no scene of his own after p.93; the second half of Chapter 4 keeps him as a recollection and a hypothesis.<span class=\"pg\">p.119–129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v2-p92-1\">← Before: Ch.4 sec. 4.3: he speaks to Sudou&#x27;s face without looking at him<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v3-p52-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2 sec  2 3   sec  2 8  the forest walk  and the retirement that costs thirty points volunteer circle for the forest search  he raises a hand last   the sun certainly is refreshing  my body needs energy  answers ayanokoji s worry about getting lost with the perfect human disclaimer    i am a perfect human being  i would never foolishly lose my way in a forest  if any problem occurs  it would most likely be because you two lost sight of me  when that happens  you should give up  reads the island in one line   i wouldn t call this a natural forest  the probability of getting lost during the day is extremely low  it s precisely for that reason that i m a little curious  poses the question the ordinary pair can t answer    what do you see when you look around    accepts  common folk are simple  after all  and walks on  skipped the return and went swimming  ayanokoji notes he ran off  suggesting that he was already familiar with the forest  retires from the test on a claimed poor physical condition  the class eats a thirty point penalty  chabashira states the rule    kouenji has retired  and he s obligated to stay onboard the ship for one week for medical treatment  the normally silent yukimura shouts and kicks the ground at the news  the class is furious and can do nothing","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v3-p52-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.3 &amp; sec. 2.8: the forest walk, and the retirement that costs thirty points<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.52–63, p.97–98<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Volunteer circle for the forest search; he raises a hand last, &quot;The sun certainly is refreshing. My body needs energy.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Answers Ayanokōji&#x27;s worry about getting lost with the perfect-human disclaimer — &quot;I am a perfect human being. I would never foolishly lose my way in a forest. If any problem occurs, it would most likely be because you two lost sight of me. When that happens, you should give up.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.55–57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Reads the island in one line: &quot;I wouldn’t call this a natural forest. The probability of getting lost during the day is extremely low. It’s precisely for that reason that I’m a little curious.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Poses the question the ordinary pair can&#x27;t answer — &quot;What do you see when you look around?&quot; — accepts &quot;Common folk are simple, after all,&quot; and walks on.<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Skipped the return and went swimming; Ayanokōji notes he ran off &quot;suggesting that he was already familiar with the forest.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Retires from the test on a claimed poor physical condition; the class eats a thirty-point penalty; Chabashira states the rule — &quot;Kouenji has retired, and he’s obligated to stay onboard the ship for one week for medical treatment.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.97–98<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> The normally silent Yukimura shouts and kicks the ground at the news; the class is furious and can do nothing.<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v3-p240-1\">→ After: Ch.7: the deck drink and the ship hint<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v3-p240-1","v":"y1v3","y":1,"o":3,"k":"spoken","w":"ike-kanji kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 7  the deck drink and the ship hint greets the class on the deck with a drink after a week of tanning  and waves off ike s thirty point accusation  named among the retired students not waiting on the cruise ship when the test ends   hello  ladies and gentlemen  how was your week on the deserted island   you jerk  kouenji  we lost thirty points because of you  you know what i m talking about  don t you   calm down  little boy ike  i was in poor health  and was resting  i had no other choice  smooth  glossy skin from a week of tanning under a claim of poor health the page calls not the least bit credible  waves off the boy s accusation with the poor health claim  the thirty points ike howls about are the retirement penalty from the volume s second chapter  named as one of the two who noticed the circling ship s  significant scenery  hint about the spot locations  alongside katsuragi","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v3-p240-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: the deck drink and the ship hint<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V3 · p.240, p.245, p.251<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Greets the class on the deck with a drink after a week of tanning, and waves off Ike’s thirty-point accusation.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ike-kanji.html\">Ike Kanji<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hello, ladies and gentlemen. How was your week on the deserted island?”<span class=\"pg\">p.245<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> “You jerk, Kouenji! We lost thirty points because of you. You know what I’m talking about, don’t you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.245<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Calm down, little boy Ike. I was in poor health, and was resting. I had no other choice.”<span class=\"pg\">p.245<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named among the retired students not waiting on the cruise ship when the test ends.<span class=\"pg\">p.240<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Smooth, glossy skin from a week of tanning under a claim of poor health the page calls not the least bit credible.<span class=\"pg\">p.245<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ike Kanji<\/b> Waves off the boy’s accusation with the poor-health claim.<span class=\"pg\">p.245<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Backstory<\/span> The thirty points Ike howls about are the retirement penalty from the volume’s second chapter.<span class=\"pg\">p.245<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Fact<\/span> Named as one of the two who noticed the circling ship’s “significant scenery” hint about the spot locations, alongside Katsuragi.<span class=\"pg\">p.251<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v3-p52-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.3 &amp; sec. 2.8: the forest walk, and the retirement that costs thirty points<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p21-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"action spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2 sec  2 1  the wet corridor and the signature corridor by the pool  dripping wet in a bathing suit  a fourth warning from the bellhop  a signature demanded   ha ha ha  it appears you ve found me  eh   i don t dry myself off with a towel on principle ever since reaching the age of reason   do you have a pen and paper on hand  signs the bellhop s notepad  kouenji rokusuke  and presents it as a future valuable gift   even though it s written on such a cheap notepad  it will certainly hold tremendous value in the future   please don t look so suspicious  i am the man who will carry japan s future on his back  repeat offender   this is the fourth hallway stop  believes his autograph outranks the notepad and pen  the narrator s standing assessment   kouenji was like poison  classmates steer clear  even hirata would be brushed off  flips his wet hair into ayanokoji s face without noticing   oh ho  why  if it isn t little ayanokouji  hmm  what a coincidence   no  no  i ve no real business with you  i ve simply acknowledged you because we are schoolmates  also  though we are certainly not alike in terms of position  you are my roommate   little ayanokouji  confirms the cabin roommate pairing and splashes him mid sentence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p21-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.1: the wet corridor and the signature<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.21–24<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Corridor by the pool: dripping wet in a bathing suit, a fourth warning from the bellhop, a signature demanded.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ha ha ha! It appears you’ve found me, eh?”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I don’t dry myself off with a towel on principle ever since reaching the age of reason.”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Do you have a pen and paper on hand?”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Signs the bellhop’s notepad “Kouenji Rokusuke” and presents it as a future-valuable gift.<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Even though it’s written on such a cheap notepad, it will certainly hold tremendous value in the future.”<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Please don’t look so suspicious. I am the man who will carry Japan’s future on his back.”<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Repeat offender — this is the fourth hallway stop; believes his autograph outranks the notepad and pen.<span class=\"pg\">p.21–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The narrator’s standing assessment: “Kouenji was like poison.” Classmates steer clear; even Hirata would be brushed off.<span class=\"pg\">p.22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Flips his wet hair into Ayanokōji’s face without noticing.<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Oh ho? Why, if it isn’t little Ayanokouji, hmm? What a coincidence.”<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “No, no, I’ve no real business with you. I’ve simply acknowledged you because we are schoolmates. Also, though we are certainly not alike in terms of position, you are my roommate.”<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “little Ayanokouji”; confirms the cabin roommate pairing and splashes him mid-sentence.<span class=\"pg\">p.23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p26-1\">→ After: Ch.2: the roommate question<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p26-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2  the roommate question named in a question about who rooms with whom  a question in the hallway confirms the roommates  ayanokoji with hirata  kouenji  and yukimura","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p26-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: the roommate question<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.26<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in a question about who rooms with whom.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> A question in the hallway confirms the roommates: Ayanokōji with Hirata, Kouenji, and Yukimura.<span class=\"pg\">p.26<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p21-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.1: the wet corridor and the signature<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p52-1\">→ After: Ch.2 sec. 2.4: absent from the room<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p52-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2 sec  2 4  absent from the room named only as missing  when ayanokoji wakes in the cabin at 20 30  the narration notes the room s other occupants are gone   neither yukimura nor kouenji were in the room    absent from the third deck cabin while hirata straightens his luggage","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p52-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2 sec. 2.4: absent from the room<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.52<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named only as missing: when Ayanokōji wakes in the cabin at 20:30, the narration notes the room’s other occupants are gone.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Neither Yukimura nor Kouenji were in the room.” — absent from the third-deck cabin while Hirata straightens his luggage.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p26-1\">← Before: Ch.2: the roommate question<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p64-1\">→ After: Ch.3: the grade-theory name-check<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p64-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka horikita-suzune kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  the grade theory name check two mentions in the cafe grade discussion   abundance without contribution  then top of class scores  ayanokoji   in terms of latent ability  kouenji had an abundance  but he probably wouldn t contribute any of it to the team  i didn t know what group he was in  horikita s score theory   yukimura kun has high academic ability  and so does kouenji kun  they re at the top of the class  the narrator who doubts he would ever help a team  named in her grouping hypothesis","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p64-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: the grade-theory name-check<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.64–65<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Two mentions in the café grade discussion — abundance without contribution, then top-of-class scores.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji: “In terms of latent ability, Kouenji had an abundance, but he probably wouldn’t contribute any of it to the team. I didn’t know what group he was in.”<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Horikita’s score theory: “Yukimura-kun has high academic ability, and so does Kouenji-kun. They’re at the top of the class.”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The narrator who doubts he would ever help a team.<span class=\"pg\">p.64<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Named in her grouping hypothesis.<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p52-1\">← Before: Ch.2 sec. 2.4: absent from the room<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p112-1\">→ After: Ch.3 sec. 3.5: push-ups, refusal, and the Monkey exit<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p112-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"action spoken","w":"yukimura-teruhiko hirata-yousuke ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3 sec  3 5  push ups  refusal  and the monkey exit naked from the waist up doing push ups in the cabin  declines the huddle  then ends the monkey group with a traitor submission while the others watch   i did say that it was pointless to include you  ayanokouji  added kouenji  how nice   sorry  hirata boy  i m far too busy with the pursuit of physical beauty  soaked with sweat  no ordinary high schooler could keep that pace    he really was exceptional in every way   well  i couldn t exactly help it  i was in awful shape  i couldn t force myself to do the impossible  answered kouenji   on the island   my  this test will be nothing but troublesome  wouldn t you say  kouenji sniffed   well  there isn t any point to continuing a test that isn t interesting  is there  finding a liar is simple  phone in hand  fiddles until all four cabin residents get the school notice  the monkey group s test has ended   of course  and now  i finally have my freedom once again  adieu    tosses the phone and slips into the bathroom  narration  remarkably perceptive and observant under the clowning   if  simple quiz to find the liar  is true   he d probably hit the mark  the shouting match he mostly ignores   hirata boy  then the restraint he calls too generous   pointless to include you","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p112-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 sec. 3.5: push-ups, refusal, and the Monkey exit<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.112–115<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Naked from the waist up doing push-ups in the cabin, declines the huddle, then ends the Monkey group with a traitor submission while the others watch.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I did say that it was pointless to include you, Ayanokouji,” added Kouenji. How nice.<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Sorry, Hirata Boy. I’m far too busy with the pursuit of physical beauty.”<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Well, I couldn’t exactly help it. I was in awful shape. I couldn’t force myself to do the impossible,” answered Kouenji. (on the island)<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>8 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Soaked with sweat, no ordinary high schooler could keep that pace — “He really was exceptional in every way.”<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “My, this test will be nothing but troublesome, wouldn’t you say?” Kouenji sniffed.<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, there isn’t any point to continuing a test that isn’t interesting, is there? Finding a liar is simple.”<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Phone in hand, fiddles until all four cabin residents get the school notice: the Monkey group’s test has ended; “Of course. And now, I finally have my freedom once again. Adieu.” — tosses the phone and slips into the bathroom.<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Narration: remarkably perceptive and observant under the clowning — if “simple quiz to find the liar” is true, “he’d probably hit the mark.”<span class=\"pg\">p.115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> The shouting match he mostly ignores.<span class=\"pg\">p.114–115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> “Hirata Boy,” then the restraint he calls too generous.<span class=\"pg\">p.112, 115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> “Pointless to include you.”<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p64-1\">← Before: Ch.3: the grade-theory name-check<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p125-1\">→ After: Ch.4 sec. 4.0: the traitor act on everyone’s lips<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p125-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka ryuuen-kakeru kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4 sec  4 0  the traitor act on everyone s lips the chapter opens on the aftermath of his monkey group traitor submission   the classes are in an uproar and horikita wants ayanokoji to answer for it as roommate  kouenji s treasonous act has circulated around the ship  the classes were in an uproar  she blames the roommate and vows to reprimand him herself  the  make him beg for mercy  line is hers  the roommate who says there is nothing he can do now   no use crying over spilt milk  ryuuen waves off the monkey group end as small fry when horikita asks  no direct appearance in this range  every row is other people reporting the act","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p125-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 sec. 4.0: the traitor act on everyone’s lips<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.125–130<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The chapter opens on the aftermath of his Monkey-group traitor submission — the classes are in an uproar and Horikita wants Ayanokōji to answer for it as roommate.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> Kouenji’s treasonous act has circulated around the ship; the classes were in an uproar.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She blames the roommate and vows to reprimand him herself; the “make him beg for mercy” line is hers.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The roommate who says there is nothing he can do now — no use crying over spilt milk.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ryuuen waves off the Monkey-group end as small fry when Horikita asks.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No direct appearance in this range; every row is other people reporting the act.<span class=\"pg\">p.125<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p112-1\">← Before: Ch.3 sec. 3.5: push-ups, refusal, and the Monkey exit<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p183-1\">→ After: Ch.4: the early end set aside<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p183-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4  the early end set aside named in the tally of the hour s betrayals   his monkey exit held apart from them  the narration sets aside the time kouenji got carried away and ended the test for his group  right now it seemed that people were betraying each other","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p183-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: the early end set aside<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.183<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the tally of the hour’s betrayals — his Monkey exit held apart from them.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> The narration sets aside the time Kouenji got carried away and ended the test for his group; right now it seemed that people were betraying each other.<span class=\"pg\">p.183<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p125-1\">← Before: Ch.4 sec. 4.0: the traitor act on everyone’s lips<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p237-1\">→ After: Ch.5 sec. 5.3: the automated calibration and the saviour<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p237-1","v":"y1v4","y":1,"o":4,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune ryuuen-kakeru kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 5 sec  5 3  the automated calibration and the saviour his earlier betrayal email fixes the school s response speed in horikita s timing deduction  p 242 names him as having saved class d s victory from total class c sweep  the data point   school responded without delay  so the four simultaneous emails must be automated   kouenji saved our asses    without his group s betrayal email the victory would have belonged exclusively to class c  his action also sent stray bullets at other vips  the four email timing kouenji s single email helped expose as one class showmanship  named only  no presence at the cafe","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p237-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 sec. 5.3: the automated calibration and the saviour<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4 · p.237–242<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">His earlier betrayal email fixes the school’s response speed in Horikita’s timing deduction; p.242 names him as having saved Class D’s victory from total Class C sweep.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> The data point — school responded without delay, so the four simultaneous emails must be automated.<span class=\"pg\">p.237<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Position<\/span> “Kouenji saved our asses” — without his group’s betrayal email the victory would have belonged exclusively to Class C; his action also sent stray bullets at other VIPs.<span class=\"pg\">p.242<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The four-email timing Kouenji’s single email helped expose as one-class showmanship.<span class=\"pg\">p.241<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Named only; no presence at the café.<span class=\"pg\">p.237-242<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4-p183-1\">← Before: Ch.4: the early end set aside<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p64-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  a passing mention koenji is named in the popularity comparison as having a degree of widespread appeal of his own","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p64-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: a passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.64<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kōenji is named in the popularity comparison as having a degree of widespread appeal of his own.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p72-1\">→ After: Ch.3: a passing mention<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p72-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"","w":"horikita-manabu kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  a passing mention named among the students with strong latent abilities ak believes the president should have approached before him  listed with katsuragi and ichinose as the obvious candidates for the vice presidency","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p72-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: a passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.72<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named among the students with strong latent abilities AK believes the president should have approached before him.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-manabu.html\">Horikita Manabu<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Manabu<\/b> Listed with Katsuragi and Ichinose as the obvious candidates for the vice presidency.<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p64-1\">← Before: Ch.3: a passing mention<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p129-1\">→ After: Ch.4: the elevator ride<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p129-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"action spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4  the elevator ride he boards the stalled elevator at the fifth floor and orders the top floor without glancing at them   elevator boy  top floor  he styles his hair in the mirrored wall with the comb he always carries  he never moves his eyes from the mirror  the water bottle goes unnoticed the whole ride","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p129-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: the elevator ride<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.129–130<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He boards the stalled elevator at the fifth floor and orders the top floor without glancing at them.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Elevator boy. Top floor,”<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> He styles his hair in the mirrored wall with the comb he always carries.<span class=\"pg\">p.129<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He never moves his eyes from the mirror; the water bottle goes unnoticed the whole ride.<span class=\"pg\">p.130<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p72-1\">← Before: Ch.3: a passing mention<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p184-1\">→ After: Ch.6: a passing mention<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p184-1","v":"y1v4.5","y":1,"o":5,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6  a passing mention kouenji is named twice as the class s other athletic wild card  and is deliberately not relied on  ayanokoji allows that kouenji might present a challenge to the opponents but judges it best not to rely on him  when weighing sudou s value  ayanokoji says few in the whole school have comparable abilities  including kouenji","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p184-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: a passing mention<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V4.5 · p.184, 194<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kouenji is named twice as the class&#x27;s other athletic wild card, and is deliberately not relied on.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ayanokōji allows that Kouenji might present a challenge to the opponents but judges it best not to rely on him.<span class=\"pg\">p.184<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> When weighing Sudou&#x27;s value, Ayanokōji says few in the whole school have comparable abilities, including Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.194<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v4_5-p129-1\">← Before: Ch.4: the elevator ride<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p39-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3 sec  3  refuses to cooperate sudou confronts koenji over his abstention in the homeroom vote  koenji refuses to join the festival plan   i have no interest in this   i have no reason to let you bully me into anything  hirata ends the standoff    kouenji kun must have his reasons  ignores sudou s taunts at the meter    i ll pass  ignore me    polishing his fingernails instead  refuses the grip strength meter when sudou challenges him  ayanokoji later writes  kouenji aside  i ended up placing second in the class  so koenji ranked above without a printed figure","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p39-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 sec. 3: Refuses to cooperate<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.39–53<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sudou confronts Kōenji over his abstention in the homeroom vote; Kōenji refuses to join the festival plan.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I have no interest in this.”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I have no reason to let you bully me into anything,”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Hirata ends the standoff — “Kouenji-kun must have his reasons.”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Ignores Sudou’s taunts at the meter — “I’ll pass. Ignore me.” — polishing his fingernails instead.<span class=\"pg\">p.49<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Refuses the grip-strength meter when Sudou challenges him; Ayanokōji later writes “Kouenji aside, I ended up placing second in the class,” so Kōenji ranked above without a printed figure.<span class=\"pg\">p.49–51<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p51-1\">→ After: Ch.3–9: passing mentions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p51-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3 9  passing mentions named as the class s other elite athlete and as an absentee across festival margins  scavenger hunt math  kouenji aside  ayanokouji placed second in the class   your only real competition s kouenji  and he probably won t take this seriously  horikita reached out to kouenji  he was lying about his cottage hideaway  sudou   since that moron kouenji ain t here  we ve gotta get that much more fired up  sudou s ally bargain close  he had to withdraw  and kouenji kun was absent from the start  two absentees  kouenji and sakayanagi  factored majorly into the fourth place first year finish  ryuuen s hallway scene  back at the start of the semester  horikita tried to convince kouenji kun to give up his bus seat","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3–9: passing mentions<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.51, 72, 95, 100, 176, 190, 195<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named as the class’s other elite athlete and as an absentee across festival margins.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Scavenger-hunt math: Kouenji aside, Ayanokouji placed second in the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “Your only real competition’s Kouenji, and he probably won’t take this seriously.”<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Horikita reached out to Kouenji; he was lying about his cottage hideaway.<span class=\"pg\">p.95<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Sudou: “Since that moron Kouenji ain’t here, we’ve gotta get that much more fired up!”<span class=\"pg\">p.100<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Sudou’s ally-bargain close: he had to withdraw, and Kouenji-kun was absent from the start.<span class=\"pg\">p.176<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Two absentees, Kouenji and Sakayanagi, factored majorly into the fourth-place first-year finish.<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ryuuen’s hallway scene: back at the start of the semester, Horikita tried to convince Kouenji-kun to give up his bus seat.<span class=\"pg\">p.195<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p39-1\">← Before: Ch.3 sec. 3: Refuses to cooperate<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p54-1\">→ After: Ch.4 sec. 4: Sits out the tests<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p54-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"","w":"sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4 sec  4  sits out the tests koenji is named among the few who sit out the aptitude testing   along with the professor  sudou s grudge  nobody in the class has seen him run seriously  though he beat sudou s swimming time  won t budge unless he wants to   his skill is obvious  his participation isn t","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p54-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 sec. 4: Sits out the tests<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.54–67<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kōenji is named among the few who sit out the aptitude testing — along with the Professor.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Sudou’s grudge: nobody in the class has seen him run seriously, though he beat Sudou’s swimming time.<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Won’t budge unless he wants to — his skill is obvious, his participation isn’t.<span class=\"pg\">p.57<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p51-1\">← Before: Ch.3–9: passing mentions<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p88-1\">→ After: Ch.6 sec. 6: the cottage refusal<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p88-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"action spoken","w":"sudou-ken horikita-suzune hirata-yousuke kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6 sec  6  the cottage refusal koenji fails to appear in his assigned lane for the third group of the 100 metre dash  the school marks an absence without searching  found inside the medical cottage fussing with his hair while class d and the red team lose a competitor   you re quite foul  aren t you   i came here to enjoy some me time  catches sudou s punch in one palm and waves him off without looking at him   you cannot hope to beat me  kouenji didn t even look at sudou as he spoke   both you and that girl seem to consider me unreliable  names that cold girl   the one inflaming sudou s passion   as horikita  who keeps pushing him to participate  the printed sentence runs across the p 90 91 break and is not quoted whole   in any case  leave now  said kouenji  waving us away   my proud carriage serves to disguise how poor my health is   if i recover  i will of course participate  replied kouenji  is lectured on violence and leader absence by hirata  then escorted out of the way as sudou is walked back  illness is openly a pose  he cooperated only through the opening ceremonies and bows out when it counts","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p88-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6: the cottage refusal<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.88–91<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kōenji fails to appear in his assigned lane for the third group of the 100-metre dash; the school marks an absence without searching.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“You’re quite foul, aren’t you?”<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I came here to enjoy some me time.”<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“You cannot hope to beat me.” Kouenji didn’t even look at Sudou as he spoke.<span class=\"pg\">p.90<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">What happens<\/span> Found inside the medical cottage fussing with his hair while Class D and the Red Team lose a competitor.<span class=\"pg\">p.89<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Catches Sudou’s punch in one palm and waves him off without looking at him.<span class=\"pg\">p.90–91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Both you and that girl seem to consider me unreliable,”<span class=\"pg\">p.91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Names that cold girl — the one inflaming Sudou’s passion — as Horikita, who keeps pushing him to participate; the printed sentence runs across the p.90–91 break and is not quoted whole.<span class=\"pg\">p.90–91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In any case, leave now.” said Kouenji, waving us away.<span class=\"pg\">p.91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “My proud carriage serves to disguise how poor my health is,”<span class=\"pg\">p.91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “If I recover, I will of course participate.” replied Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Is lectured on violence and leader-absence by Hirata, then escorted out of the way as Sudou is walked back.<span class=\"pg\">p.91<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Illness is openly a pose; he cooperated only through the opening ceremonies and bows out when it counts.<span class=\"pg\">p.89–91<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p54-1\">← Before: Ch.4 sec. 4: Sits out the tests<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p134-1\">→ After: Ch.6 sec. 6: still absent<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p134-1","v":"y1v5","y":1,"o":6,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6 sec  6  still absent with sudou gone  the page notes koenji was already absent   class d s two strongest both off the board  no new koenji action in the second half  the morning ends on his continued absence","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p134-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 sec. 6: still absent<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V5 · p.134<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">With Sudou gone, the page notes Kōenji was already absent — Class D’s two strongest both off the board.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No new Kōenji action in the second half; the morning ends on his continued absence.<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v5-p88-1\">← Before: Ch.6 sec. 6: the cottage refusal<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p44-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"spoken","w":"kushida-kikyou horikita-suzune sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  bus seat and bare hands limit named in the first day bus memory  he also refused to give up his seat for the elderly woman  his refusal did not make him the unique target of kushida s hate   suzune alone is hated  cited as someone horikita cannot imagine defeating with her bare hands   i can t imagine defeating sudou kun or kouenji kun with my bare hands  besides  there are also people like you whose strengths i don t fully know  named with sudou as the physical strength floor of the class","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p44-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: bus seat and bare-hands limit<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.44, 47<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in the first-day bus memory: he also refused to give up his seat for the elderly woman.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"kushida-kikyou.html\">Kushida Kikyō<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> “I can’t imagine defeating Sudou-kun or Kouenji-kun with my bare hands. Besides, there are also people like you whose strengths I don’t fully know”<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kushida Kikyō<\/b> His refusal did not make him the unique target of Kushida’s hate — Suzune alone is hated.<span class=\"pg\">p.44<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Cited as someone Horikita cannot imagine defeating with her bare hands.<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Named with Sudou as the physical-strength floor of the class.<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p79-1\">→ After: Ch.5: the balance risk<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p79-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune okiya-kyousuke kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 5  the balance risk legs across desk  combing hair  refuses neither support nor rejection of horikita s plan   no  what a nonsensical question  naturally  i fully grasp the situation   well  i m not too sure about that  wouldn t that depend on the test s contents   i will consider the matter carefully  girl  pressed not to score a zero and break the pair balance  she cannot pursue further  paired with okiya on the short quiz   a sufficiently high score as hoped  crosses arms  grins  laughs when the pairings are read  legs across desk  combing hair  refuses neither support nor rejection of horikita s plan   no  what a nonsensical question  naturally  i fully grasp the situation   well  i m not too sure about that  wouldn t that depend on the test s contents   i will consider the matter carefully  girl  pressed not to score a zero and break the pair balance  she cannot pursue further  paired with okiya on the short quiz   a sufficiently high score as hoped  crosses arms  grins  laughs when the pairings are read","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p79-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5: the balance risk<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.79, 83<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Legs across desk, combing hair; refuses neither support nor rejection of Horikita’s plan. Legs across desk, combing hair; refuses neither support nor rejection of Horikita’s plan.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#okiya-kyousuke\">Okiya Kyōsuke<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“No. What a nonsensical question. Naturally, I fully grasp the situation.”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Well, I’m not too sure about that. Wouldn’t that depend on the test’s contents?”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I will consider the matter carefully, girl.”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Pressed not to score a zero and break the pair balance; she cannot pursue further.<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Okiya Kyōsuke<\/b> Paired with Okiya on the short quiz — a sufficiently high score as hoped.<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Crosses arms, grins, laughs when the pairings are read.<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “No. What a nonsensical question. Naturally, I fully grasp the situation.”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, I’m not too sure about that. Wouldn’t that depend on the test’s contents?”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I will consider the matter carefully, girl.”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Pressed not to score a zero and break the pair balance; she cannot pursue further.<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Okiya Kyōsuke<\/b> Paired with Okiya on the short quiz — a sufficiently high score as hoped.<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Crosses arms, grins, laughs when the pairings are read.<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p44-1\">← Before: Ch.3: bus seat and bare-hands limit<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p137-1\">→ After: Ch.6: the one face Hiyori will keep<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p137-1","v":"y1v6","y":1,"o":7,"k":"spoken","w":"shiina-hiyori ryuuen-kakeru kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6  the one face hiyori will keep named from the earlier suspect group as the face hiyori says she will remember   well  he s unique  ryuuen treats kouenji as a talent to watch even though he is far from a team player  of the four names she recites  only his sticks  no scene presence  named only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p137-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: the one face Hiyori will keep<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V6 · p.137<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named from the earlier suspect group as the face Hiyori says she will remember.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"shiina-hiyori.html\">Shiina Hiyori<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> “Well, he’s unique,”<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ryuuen treats Kouenji as a talent to watch even though he is far from a team player.<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Shiina Hiyori<\/b> Of the four names she recites, only his sticks.<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No scene presence; named only.<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v6-p79-1\">← Before: Ch.5: the balance risk<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p51-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"hasebe-haruka yukimura-teruhiko miyake-akito kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  candidate  then cleared proposed as the class d mastermind because he is brilliant  athletic and perfect   then ruled out  haruka  maybe the personality is a front for a cold schemer  keisei  retired on day one of the island test  could not have known their situation  everyone shakes their heads  primary proposer  primary demolisher of the theory   he s nuts","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p51-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: candidate, then cleared<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.51–52<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Proposed as the Class D mastermind because he is brilliant, athletic and perfect — then ruled out.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hasebe-haruka.html\">Hasebe Haruka<\/a> · <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"miyake-akito.html\">Miyake Akito<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Haruka: maybe the personality is a front for a cold schemer.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Keisei: retired on day one of the island test; could not have known their situation; everyone shakes their heads.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hasebe Haruka<\/b> Primary proposer.<span class=\"pg\">p.51<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Primary demolisher of the theory.<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Miyake Akito<\/b> “He’s nuts.”<span class=\"pg\">p.52<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p73-1\">→ After: Ch.3: hope list<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p73-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"chabashira-sae kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  hope list on chabashira s four student hope list   one of the reasons she still burns for class a  named student in her concealed desire","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p73-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: hope list<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.73<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> On Chabashira’s four-student hope list — one of the reasons she still burns for Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Named student in her concealed desire.<span class=\"pg\">p.73<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p51-1\">← Before: Ch.3: candidate, then cleared<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p100-1\">→ After: Ch.4: the bait who does not care<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p100-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru sakayanagi-arisu horikita-suzune sudou-ken hashimoto-masayoshi kitou-hayato ibuki-mio kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4  the bait who does not care leaves the classroom through the raid without looking back  ends at the rest area styling hair with ryuuen s hands for a mirror   what re you doing  i don t recall behaving in any way that d warrant you flagging me down   hmph  you certainly don t  either  replied kouenji   of course  you re class c s obnoxious dictator  aren t you  said kouenji   my apologies  i m afraid i must ve been busy  whenever you missed me  said kouenji  smoothing his hair back   however  you just said something i m afraid i cannot overlook  when you said  freak  were you referring to me   well  even though i find your statement entirely baffling  i suppose i ll just let it go  i m quite a magnanimous fellow  you see  i have a date  so let s wrap things up quickly  shall we   well  i suppose we ll discuss your business over there  he said eventually  pointing to a rest area up ahead   then follow me   i don t particularly mind playing around  but it seems that my presence here isn t a necessity  would you agree  asked kouenji   a debt  i haven t the foggiest notion of what you mean   ah  if i impeded you  you have my apologies   it s quite windy today  i m making sure my debonair hairdo isn t mussed up   i m looking tragically disheveled  sorry  but would you mind holding this   you may aim the mirror toward me  said kouenji   you really are quite the scoundrel  that mirror was rather expensive  you know   tch  in that case  will you kindly release my arm so i may finish styling my hair  of course  i m the kind of man who d look good even with disheveled hair  said kouenji   i don t mind that our audience has grown  but isn t it about time that we end this  if we aren t going to talk  i ll be on my way   my apologies that our conversation was delayed  i think we should get to the heart of the matter  i surmise that you re fixated on defeating whomever gets in class c s way  or whomever forms an   alliance with another class to do exactly that  am i wrong   and now  such an obstreperous person has appeared within class d  so  you re searching for this hindrance  said kouenji   in that case  i m afraid i don t fit the profile  i have absolutely no interest whatsoever in class d s future  nor in any of the other classes  i ve contributed nothing noteworthy to any exam thus far  and i have no intention of doing so  tell me  are you truly fixated on making such a person your enemy   oh ho  you seem to be quite the knowledgeable fellow   oh  that  i was simply saving time  i didn t really feel like participating in those bothersome meetings  so i decided to end it and enjoy my freedom again  nothing more  said kouenji   i suppose that s possible  but if it s the conclusion you ve settled on  it must mean you re a moron with a paltry intellect  said kouenji   yes  you re quite perceptive  dragon boy   now that s just nonsensical  you wouldn t do that here  with this large of an audience  it wouldn t benefit you at all   i see  i suppose that if you did choose that option  i d defend by pride and knock down everyone who came at me  said kouenji   you could do that by yourself   i find it harder to imagine why i couldn t   so glad to have cleared up this misunderstanding  replied kouenji   are we finished here  i have no intention of denying you your fun  but i d like for you to get out of my way  i ve wasted enough time listening to your meaningless drivel  said kouenji   something about a clever person in class d  was it  to be honest  i hadn t even considered it  at any rate  it s probably better if i don t tell you  right  you re doing whatever it takes to hunt this person down  even if it means putting yourself at risk  i don t wish to rob you of your fun  as for me  i don t care for anyone in this school  i m simply enjoying the halcyon days of my youth  romancing beautiful women and basking in my own beauty   so  you re saying you won t help your own class   i haven t  and i won t  i said that all along  from my perspective  class a and class d are the same  all of you people are so dreadfully boring   did i really hurt your feelings that much  little girl  kouenji pointed at sakayanagi  that s not for you to decide  calling you a little girl is appropriate  considering your age and physique  replied kouenji   being a slave to common practice isn t my style  said kouenji   i have no business with class a  leave now  commanded kouenji   allow me to correct this boy s behavior  said kitou to sakayanagi    wrong speaker  remove  ha ha  well  i don t mind you fighting over me  unfortunately  my tastes in both men and women run toward older people  said kouenji   very well  then  see you  said kouenji  dictator  freak  dragon boy  moron   the whole rest area duel  little girl jab  the audience he does not need  shards picked after his arm is released  fists and glass around him  one of the three class a faces he toys with  correct the boy offer he waves off  with the path pack watching  arrogance as armor  hair and mirror as props  claims total indifference while reading ryuuen s game perfectly  the storm was him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p100-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: the bait who does not care<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.100–117<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Leaves the classroom through the raid without looking back; ends at the rest area styling hair with Ryuuen’s hands for a mirror.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a> · <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"hashimoto-masayoshi.html\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/a> · <a href=\"kitou-hayato.html\">Kitō Hayato<\/a> <span class=\"n\">+1 more<\/span><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“What’re you doing? I don’t recall behaving in any way that’d warrant you flagging me down.”<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Hmph. You certainly don’t, either,” replied Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Of course. You’re Class C’s obnoxious dictator, aren’t you?” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>45 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “My apologies. I’m afraid I must’ve been busy, whenever you missed me,” said Kouenji, smoothing his hair back.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “However, you just said something I’m afraid I cannot overlook. When you said ‘freak,’ were you referring to me?”<span class=\"pg\">p.104<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, even though I find your statement entirely baffling, I suppose I’ll just let it go. I’m quite a magnanimous fellow, you see. I have a date, so let’s wrap things up quickly, shall we?”<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Well, I suppose we’ll discuss your business over there,” he said eventually, pointing to a rest area up ahead.<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Then follow me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don’t particularly mind playing around, but it seems that my presence here isn’t a necessity. Would you agree?” asked Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “A debt? I haven’t the foggiest notion of what you mean.”<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ah. If I impeded you, you have my apologies.”<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It’s quite windy today. I’m making sure my debonair hairdo isn’t mussed up.”<span class=\"pg\">p.107<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’m looking tragically disheveled. Sorry, but would you mind holding this?”<span class=\"pg\">p.108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You may aim the mirror toward me,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You really are quite the scoundrel. That mirror was rather expensive, you know.”<span class=\"pg\">p.108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Tch. In that case, will you kindly release my arm so I may finish styling my hair? Of course, I’m the kind of man who’d look good even with disheveled hair,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I don’t mind that our audience has grown, but isn’t it about time that we end this? If we aren’t going to talk, I’ll be on my way.”<span class=\"pg\">p.109<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “My apologies that our conversation was delayed. I think we should get to the heart of the matter. I surmise that you’re fixated on defeating whomever gets in Class C’s way, or whomever forms an … alliance with another class to do exactly that. Am I wrong?”<span class=\"pg\">p.109–110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “And now, such an obstreperous person has appeared within Class D. So, you’re searching for this hindrance,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “In that case, I’m afraid I don’t fit the profile. I have absolutely no interest whatsoever in Class D’s future, nor in any of the other classes. I’ve contributed nothing noteworthy to any exam thus far, and I have no intention of doing so. Tell me, are you truly fixated on making such a person your enemy?”<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Oh ho. You seem to be quite the knowledgeable fellow.”<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Oh, that. I was simply saving time. I didn’t really feel like participating in those bothersome meetings, so I decided to end it and enjoy my freedom again. Nothing more,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I suppose that’s possible. But if it’s the conclusion you’ve settled on, it must mean you’re a moron with a paltry intellect,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.110<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Yes. You’re quite perceptive, Dragon Boy.”<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Now that’s just nonsensical. You wouldn’t do that here, with this large of an audience. It wouldn’t benefit you at all.”<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I see. I suppose that if you did choose that option, I’d defend by pride and knock down everyone who came at me,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You could do that by yourself?”<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I find it harder to imagine why I couldn’t.”<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So glad to have cleared up this misunderstanding,” replied Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Are we finished here? I have no intention of denying you your fun, but I’d like for you to get out of my way. I’ve wasted enough time listening to your meaningless drivel,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Something about a clever person in Class D, was it? To be honest, I hadn’t even considered it. At any rate, it’s probably better if I don’t tell you, right? You’re doing whatever it takes to hunt this person down, even if it means putting yourself at risk. I don’t wish to rob you of your fun. As for me, I don’t care for anyone in this school. I’m simply enjoying the halcyon days of my youth, romancing beautiful women and basking in my own beauty.”<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “So, you’re saying you won’t help your own class?”<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I haven’t, and I won’t. I said that all along. From my perspective, Class A and Class D are the same. All of you people are so dreadfully boring.”<span class=\"pg\">p.115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Did I really hurt your feelings that much, little girl?” Kouenji pointed at Sakayanagi<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That’s not for you to decide. Calling you a little girl is appropriate, considering your age and physique,” replied Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Being a slave to common practice isn’t my style,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I have no business with Class A. Leave now,” commanded Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Allow me to correct this boy’s behavior,” said Kitou to Sakayanagi. — wrong speaker, remove<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ha ha! Well, I don’t mind you fighting over me. Unfortunately, my tastes in both men and women run toward older people,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Very well, then. See you,” said Kouenji.<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Dictator, freak, Dragon Boy, moron — the whole rest-area duel.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–117<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Little-girl jab; the audience he does not need.<span class=\"pg\">p.109–116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Shards picked after his arm is released.<span class=\"pg\">p.106–108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Fists and glass around him.<span class=\"pg\">p.106–108<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hashimoto Masayoshi<\/b> One of the three Class A faces he toys with.<span class=\"pg\">p.115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kitō Hayato<\/b> Correct-the-boy offer he waves off.<span class=\"pg\">p.116<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ibuki Mio<\/b> With the path pack watching.<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Arrogance as armor; hair and mirror as props; claims total indifference while reading Ryuuen’s game perfectly; the storm was him.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–117<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p73-1\">← Before: Ch.3: hope list<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p123-1\">→ After: Ch.5 sec. 5.1: the press nobody knows<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p123-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 5 sec  5 1  the press nobody knows named in one line of ryuuen s plan notes  the reason stays hidden from his own followers  ibuki and the rest do not know the real reason ryuuen pressed kouenji after the paper shuffle  the class d student he separately pressed while keeping the true aim from class c","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p123-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5 sec. 5.1: the press nobody knows<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.123<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in one line of Ryuuen’s plan notes; the reason stays hidden from his own followers.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Ibuki and the rest do not know the real reason Ryuuen pressed Kouenji after the Paper Shuffle.<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The Class D student he separately pressed while keeping the true aim from Class C.<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p100-1\">← Before: Ch.4: the bait who does not care<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p181-1\">→ After: Ch.6: the open move that bought thinking time<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p181-1","v":"y1v7","y":1,"o":8,"k":"","w":"ryuuen-kakeru ayanokouji-kiyotaka komiya-kyogo kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6  the open move that bought thinking time named only as the class d student ryuuen moved against openly  hoping it would pressure x   moved openly against kouenji yourself  thinking that it would put pressure on x  i imagine you genuinely enjoyed yourself  but you actually gave me some time to think  the class c leader who walked into a useful distraction  the x who used the pressure as free time  one of the tails on the same campaign","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p181-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: the open move that bought thinking time<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7 · p.181<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named only as the Class D student Ryuuen moved against openly, hoping it would pressure X.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> “moved openly against Kouenji yourself, thinking that it would put pressure on X. I imagine you genuinely enjoyed yourself, but you actually gave me some time to think.”<span class=\"pg\">p.181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> The Class C leader who walked into a useful distraction.<span class=\"pg\">p.181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> The X who used the pressure as free time.<span class=\"pg\">p.181<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> One of the tails on the same campaign.<span class=\"pg\">p.181<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7-p123-1\">← Before: Ch.5 sec. 5.1: the press nobody knows<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7_5-p37-1","v":"y1v7.5","y":1,"o":9,"k":"spoken","w":"ryuuen-kakeru sakayanagi-arisu kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  named as a puppet master candidate one line name hit in the sakayanagi exchange   probably because there re quite a few talented candidates for puppet master in class d  kouenji  in particular  is very capable    speaker is ayanokoji  kouenji does not speak in ch3  sakayanagi agrees he is a suitable opponent for dragon boy  part of the third semester preview she wants to wait for","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v7_5-p37-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: named as a puppet-master candidate<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V7.5 · p.37<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">One-line name-hit in the Sakayanagi exchange.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Probably because there’re quite a few talented candidates for puppet master in Class D. Kouenji, in particular, is very capable,” — speaker is Ayanokōji; Kouenji does not speak in ch3.<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Sakayanagi agrees he is a suitable opponent for Dragon Boy.<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> Part of the third-semester preview she wants to wait for.<span class=\"pg\">p.37<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p47-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"nagumo-miyabi ishizaki-daichi yukimura-teruhiko kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2  the boycott  the bust  and the bed leftover class c seat who refuses every discussion  later dominates the representative fight and the dorm bed scramble   i will not participate in rock paper scissors  i have no interest in being representative   why not go ahead and make me the group representative   i may even boycott the exam   i lied because i don t want to be the representative  has his class a cash point plan laid bare  concedes the plan is revealed and therefore he has no reason to take the rep role  applauds nagumo s logic with  bravo  bravo  ishizaki wants to force the rep role on him  then loses the bunk he claimed when koenji simply takes it  yukimura takes the bed beneath him  no one else wants that spot  outlines buying third years  cashed out private points with outside money    i have tens of millions of yen at my disposal  willing to be expelled on paper  only contradiction is that he also does not want expulsion   nagumo calls the aimless act  then the honest restatement","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p47-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: the boycott, the bust, and the bed<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.47–70<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Leftover Class C seat who refuses every discussion; later dominates the representative fight and the dorm bed scramble.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I will not participate in rock-paper-scissors. I have no interest in being representative.”<span class=\"pg\">p.62<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“why not go ahead and make me the group representative?”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I may even boycott the exam.”<span class=\"pg\">p.63<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I lied because I don’t want to be the representative.”<span class=\"pg\">p.65<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Has his Class A cash-point plan laid bare; concedes the plan is revealed and therefore he has no reason to take the rep role; applauds Nagumo’s logic with “Bravo, bravo.”<span class=\"pg\">p.64–68<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Ishizaki wants to force the rep role on him, then loses the bunk he claimed when Kōenji simply takes it.<span class=\"pg\">p.62–64, 69–70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Yukimura takes the bed beneath him; no one else wants that spot.<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Outlines buying third-years’ cashed-out private points with outside money — “I have tens of millions of yen at my disposal.”<span class=\"pg\">p.65–66<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Willing to be expelled on paper; only contradiction is that he also does not want expulsion — Nagumo calls the aimless act, then the honest restatement.<span class=\"pg\">p.63–65<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p48-1\">→ After: Ch.2–9: passing mentions<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p48-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2 9  passing mentions named across the group selection  card game and exam margin pages without individual rows beyond his cited scenes  called out as one who will not follow orders  called  a threat  at the very least  in the post exam read","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p48-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2–9: passing mentions<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.48, 50–51, 86, 100, 107, 128, 154, 156, 160, 166, 172, 193, 207<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named across the group-selection, card-game and exam-margin pages without individual rows beyond his cited scenes.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Called out as one who will not follow orders.<span class=\"pg\">p.166<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Called “a threat, at the very least” in the post-exam read.<span class=\"pg\">p.207<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p47-1\">← Before: Ch.2: the boycott, the bust, and the bed<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p77-1\">→ After: Ch.3: training, lotus, and the card-game bait<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p77-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"yukimura-teruhiko ishizaki-daichi nagumo-miyabi ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  training  lotus  and the card game bait returns to the dorm sweated from dawn training  later dominates zazen posture and needles nagumo about the final old maid   good morning  gentlemen  were you about to search for me   even after a full session of training  i have unimaginable reserves of stamina to spare   what do you mean   promise  have you sworn allegiance to this randomly selected group  i don t see it that way   it s been amusing to watch  but now that i ve dealt with you directly  i ve frankly had my fill   i happen to be a pacifist   wouldn t it be the absolute height of stupidity to hold myself back in order to keep pace with common riffraff   i haven t the slightest interest in this exchange   student council president nagumo    asks how he foresees the final game ending  refuses yukimura s cooperation demand and throws the cruise ship shared room training memory in his face  calls ishizaki a delinquent on red hair kun s path and baits him to the edge of missing assembly  declines the student council invite  plants the foreseen outcome question that makes nagumo state the seniors will win   ayanokoji reads the smile as satisfied  sits lotus with no correction while most students cannot lift one leg    looking as though he d already entered a state of zen  ignores ayanokoji s pace plea  returns to his own world    talking to him was a wasted effort","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p77-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: training, lotus, and the card-game bait<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.77–106<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Returns to the dorm sweated from dawn training; later dominates zazen posture and needles Nagumo about the final Old Maid.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Good morning, gentlemen. Were you about to search for me?”<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Even after a full session of training, I have unimaginable reserves of stamina to spare.”<span class=\"pg\">p.77<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“What do you mean, ‘promise’? Have you sworn allegiance to this randomly selected group? I don’t see it that way.”<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It’s been amusing to watch, but now that I’ve dealt with you directly, I’ve frankly had my fill.”<span class=\"pg\">p.78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I happen to be a pacifist”<span class=\"pg\">p.79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “wouldn’t it be the absolute height of stupidity to hold myself back in order to keep pace with common riffraff?”<span class=\"pg\">p.88<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I haven’t the slightest interest in this exchange.”<span class=\"pg\">p.98<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Student Council President Nagumo.” — asks how he foresees the final game ending.<span class=\"pg\">p.105<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Refuses Yukimura’s cooperation demand and throws the cruise-ship shared-room training memory in his face.<span class=\"pg\">p.77–78<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Calls Ishizaki a delinquent on Red-Hair-kun’s path and baits him to the edge of missing assembly.<span class=\"pg\">p.78–79<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Declines the student-council invite; plants the foreseen-outcome question that makes Nagumo state the seniors will win — Ayanokōji reads the smile as satisfied.<span class=\"pg\">p.98, 105–106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Sits lotus with no correction while most students cannot lift one leg — “looking as though he’d already entered a state of zen.”<span class=\"pg\">p.83<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Ignores Ayanokōji’s pace plea; returns to his own world — “talking to him was a wasted effort.”<span class=\"pg\">p.87–88<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p48-1\">← Before: Ch.2–9: passing mentions<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p111-1\">→ After: Ch.4: bathroom alibi and the value speech<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p111-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"ishizaki-daichi kiriyama-ikuto ishikura kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4  bathroom alibi and the value speech vanishes for half an hour at dawn cook duty  later refuses kiriyama s group unease lecture in the classroom   a group that s made uneasy by my actions is a group that has no value   i m worth far more than the rest of you combined  an average person cannot correctly judge the exceptional   simple is best  this is me we re talking about  no  bathroom stomachache story returns only at breakfast  relation with ishizaki wrecked beyond repair  target of kiriyama s attitude talk  refuses group judgment    then who  may i ask  does  sole first year who does not nod when ishikura asks for confirmation  half hour unexplained absence then an unflinching exceptionalism line under second year encirclement","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p111-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: bathroom alibi and the value speech<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.111–117<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Vanishes for half an hour at dawn cook duty; later refuses Kiriyama’s group-unease lecture in the classroom.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"kiriyama-ikuto.html\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/a> · <a href=\"ishikura.html\">Ishikura<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“A group that’s made uneasy by my actions is a group that has no value.”<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I’m worth far more than the rest of you combined. An average person cannot correctly judge the exceptional.”<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Simple is best. This is me we’re talking about, no?”<span class=\"pg\">p.117<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Bathroom stomachache story returns only at breakfast; relation with Ishizaki wrecked beyond repair.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–112<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama Ikuto<\/b> Target of Kiriyama’s attitude talk; refuses group judgment — “Then who, may I ask, does?”<span class=\"pg\">p.116–117<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishikura<\/b> Sole first-year who does not nod when Ishikura asks for confirmation.<span class=\"pg\">p.118<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Half-hour unexplained absence then an unflinching exceptionalism line under second-year encirclement.<span class=\"pg\">p.111, 117<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p77-1\">← Before: Ch.3: training, lotus, and the card-game bait<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p134-1\">→ After: Ch.4: the perfect being in the tub<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p134-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"yamada-albert ayanokouji-kiyotaka sudou-ken ryuuen-kakeru kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4  the perfect being in the tub observes from inside the hot tub  accepts yamauchi s bait  unveils as the tank  and claims victory over ayanokoji by experience   ha ha ha  you are all amusing yourselves like children  it seems   i am a perfect being  as a man  i possess the ultimate body   there is no need for a competition  precisely because i know that there is no one superior to me   i m not so foolish as to direct my blade toward an unworthy opponent   and thus  i have proven that i am a perfect being   ha ha ha  no need to feel embarrassed  ayanokouji boy   you are all living witnesses to history  expression changes when albert dwarfs katsuragi  unveils against the  representing the rest of the world  frame  still claims victory by prey count  addresses him as ayanokouji boy  the near t rex line ends with  a margin of a few millimeters might as well be nonexistent  sudou s life leaves his eyes at the perfect being claim  later  are you even human  ryuuen s plant targets him as much as ayanokoji   interest piqued by the hidden power line  first dramatic expression change is when albert stands beside katsuragi  then the towel drop silences the room","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p134-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: the perfect being in the tub<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.134–140<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Observes from inside the hot tub; accepts Yamauchi’s bait, unveils as the tank, and claims victory over Ayanokōji by experience.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"yamada-albert.html\">Yamada Albert<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Ha ha ha. You are all amusing yourselves like children, it seems.”<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I am a perfect being. As a man, I possess the ultimate body.”<span class=\"pg\">p.135<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“There is no need for a competition, precisely because I know that there is no one superior to me.”<span class=\"pg\">p.135<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I’m not so foolish as to direct my blade toward an unworthy opponent.”<span class=\"pg\">p.136<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “And thus, I have proven that I am a perfect being.”<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Ha ha ha! No need to feel embarrassed, Ayanokouji Boy.”<span class=\"pg\">p.138<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You are all living witnesses to history”<span class=\"pg\">p.140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamada Albert<\/b> Expression changes when Albert dwarfs Katsuragi; unveils against the “representing the rest of the world” frame; still claims victory by prey-count.<span class=\"pg\">p.136–140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Addresses him as Ayanokouji Boy; the near-T-rex line ends with “a margin of a few millimeters might as well be nonexistent.”<span class=\"pg\">p.138–140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Sudou’s life leaves his eyes at the perfect-being claim; later “Are you even human?”<span class=\"pg\">p.135, 140<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Ryuuen’s plant targets him as much as Ayanokōji — interest piqued by the hidden-power line.<span class=\"pg\">p.137<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> First dramatic expression change is when Albert stands beside Katsuragi; then the towel drop silences the room.<span class=\"pg\">p.136–137<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p111-1\">← Before: Ch.4: bathroom alibi and the value speech<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p155-1\">→ After: Ch.6 half 1: the forest detour and the roll-call shout<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p155-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka ryuuen-kakeru chabashira-sae kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6 half 1  the forest detour and the roll call shout veers off the byroad into the forest  pursued and confronted on the dirt road   oh  ho  if it isn t ayanokouji boy  this isn t the correct route  is it   i caught a glimpse of a wild boar  i dare say i was interested  so i gave chase   rest easy  i shall return in time  it shouldn t take someone like me even thirty minutes   you do not get to decide that  i do  you know that  don t you  i will see you later   the person who tamed the dragon boy   because of your touch on my arm  i can tell by the heat being transmitted through your skin   i will act in accordance with my own wishes  that is my philosophy   my name is kouenji rokusuke  remember it well  teacher   wild boar    chabashira s echo  see  note  confronted over the detour  reads ryuuen taming from arm heat  refuses group help and walks off to the boar  named  dragon boy     delinquent kun  as the one ayanokoji allegedly tamed  last at the turnaround  skips class on the roll call  boisterous laughter down the hill  wild boar chase as cover  philosophy of moment to moment grades   small fry to me  on the secret  around in twenty minutes with leaf and dirt traces   limitless stamina  number one in our grade level  won t be persuaded on group help","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p155-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 half 1: the forest detour and the roll-call shout<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.155–162<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Veers off the byroad into the forest; pursued and confronted on the dirt road.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"ryuuen-kakeru.html\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/a> · <a href=\"chabashira-sae.html\">Chabashira Sae<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Oh, ho, if it isn’t Ayanokouji Boy. This isn’t the correct route, is it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I caught a glimpse of a wild boar. I dare say I was interested. So I gave chase.”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Rest easy. I shall return in time. It shouldn’t take someone like me even thirty minutes”<span class=\"pg\">p.157<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>12 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “You do not get to decide that. I do. You know that, don’t you? I will see you later”<span class=\"pg\">p.158<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “The person who tamed the Dragon Boy.”<span class=\"pg\">p.158<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Because of your touch on my arm. I can tell by the heat being transmitted through your skin.”<span class=\"pg\">p.158<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “I will act in accordance with my own wishes. That is my philosophy.”<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “My name is Kouenji Rokusuke. Remember it well, teacher”<span class=\"pg\">p.162<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Wild boar?” — Chabashira’s echo; see [note].<span class=\"pg\">p.162<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Confronted over the detour; reads Ryuuen-taming from arm heat; refuses group help and walks off to the boar.<span class=\"pg\">p.157–159<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ryūen Kakeru<\/b> Named “Dragon Boy” / “Delinquent-kun” as the one Ayanokōji allegedly tamed.<span class=\"pg\">p.158<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Chabashira Sae<\/b> Last at the turnaround; skips class on the roll call; boisterous laughter down the hill.<span class=\"pg\">p.161–162<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Wild-boar chase as cover; philosophy of moment-to-moment grades; “small fry to me” on the secret.<span class=\"pg\">p.157–159<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Around in twenty minutes with leaf-and-dirt traces; “limitless stamina… number one in our grade level.”<span class=\"pg\">p.161–163<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Won’t be persuaded on group help.<span class=\"pg\">p.159<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p134-1\">← Before: Ch.4: the perfect being in the tub<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p171-1\">→ After: Ch.6 half 2: the broom that fails<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p171-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"totsuka-yahiko ishizaki-daichi kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6 half 2  the broom that fails still never cleans  yahiko s thrust ends in the other boy s exhaustion  total non participation in cleaning   the group s permanent hole  the one who tries him with a broom and gives up  cannot be argued with in  japanese  gorilla frame  no dialogue this half   presence is the refusal itself","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p171-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6 half 2: the broom that fails<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.171<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Still never cleans; Yahiko’s thrust ends in the other boy’s exhaustion.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"totsuka-yahiko.html\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Total non-participation in cleaning — the group’s permanent hole.<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Totsuka Yahiko<\/b> The one who tries him with a broom and gives up.<span class=\"pg\">p.170–171<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Cannot be argued with in “Japanese”; gorilla frame.<span class=\"pg\">p.170–171<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> No dialogue this half — presence is the refusal itself.<span class=\"pg\">p.171<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p155-1\">← Before: Ch.6 half 1: the forest detour and the roll-call shout<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p188-1\">→ After: Ch.7 half 1: the bare-minimum bargain<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p188-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"yukimura-teruhiko ishizaki-daichi sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 7 half 1  the bare minimum bargain dorm relay  refuses the points pool  promises only the floor  strolls out of dusting   i will run  of course  however  unlike those fellows  i am not so   inclined to run long distances   i suppose so  i understand what you re saying  glasses kun   even if running long distance is impossible  i will at least run 1 2 kilometers with serious effort   unfortunately for you  i m not exactly struggling as far as private   points are concerned  besides  i could lead a fulfilling life at school even if i didn t have any points  you see   yes  i suppose so   it doesn t seem that i will be an asset to you all   however  rest assured about one thing  while i don t intend to do anything more than what is required  i will do the bare minimum  i have my own way of doing things  you see   that is correct  of course  even by doing the bare minimum  i will still most likely produce superior results  i suppose this is good news for you all  isn t it   heh  i mastered things like zazen in my early childhood  it s no problem   quite prudent of you  delinquent kun   is that so  ha ha ha  called glasses kun  takes the floor promise as the win  points pool ignored  glare held back   shut your piehole  answered with laughter  disease line from class d onlookers  named the athletic ceiling even sudou would not hold a candle to   pov analysis  knows keisei will not invoke solidarity against him  99 percent  refuses cash  zazen since early childhood  bare minimum still  most likely superior results    physical ceiling the group banks on  zero cleaning   not a single damn thing since the first damn day","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p188-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7 half 1: the bare-minimum bargain<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.188–192<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Dorm relay; refuses the points pool; promises only the floor; strolls out of dusting.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“I will run, of course. However, unlike those fellows, I am not so”<span class=\"pg\">p.188<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“inclined to run long distances”<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I suppose so. I understand what you’re saying, Glasses-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>16 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Even if running long-distance is impossible, I will at least run 1.2 kilometers with serious effort.”<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Unfortunately for you, I’m not exactly struggling as far as private”<span class=\"pg\">p.189<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “points are concerned. Besides, I could lead a fulfilling life at school even if I didn’t have any points, you see.”<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Yes, I suppose so”<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “It doesn’t seem that I will be an asset to you all”<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “However, rest assured about one thing. While I don’t intend to do anything more than what is required, I will do the bare minimum. I have my own way of doing things, you see.”<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “That is correct. Of course, even by doing the bare minimum, I will still most likely produce superior results. I suppose this is good news for you all, isn’t it?”<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Heh. I mastered things like zazen in my early childhood. It’s no problem.”<span class=\"pg\">p.191<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Quite prudent of you, Delinquent-kun.”<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Is that so? Ha ha ha!”<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Called Glasses-kun; takes the floor promise as the win; points pool ignored.<span class=\"pg\">p.188–190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Glare held back; “Shut your piehole” answered with laughter; disease line from Class D onlookers.<span class=\"pg\">p.189, 191–192<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Named the athletic ceiling even Sudou would not hold a candle to — POV analysis.<span class=\"pg\">p.186–188<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Knows Keisei will not invoke solidarity against him (99 percent); refuses cash; zazen since early childhood.<span class=\"pg\">p.189–191<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Bare minimum still “most likely…superior results” — physical ceiling the group banks on.<span class=\"pg\">p.190<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Zero cleaning — not a single damn thing since the first damn day.<span class=\"pg\">p.192<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p171-1\">← Before: Ch.6 half 2: the broom that fails<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p211-1\">→ After: Ch.7 closer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p211-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 7 closer no further presence in chapter 7 after half 1","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p211-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7 closer<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.211<\/span><\/h3><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> No further presence in chapter 7 after half 1.<span class=\"pg\">p.211<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p188-1\">← Before: Ch.7 half 1: the bare-minimum bargain<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p216-1\">→ After: Ch.9 half 1: flawless zazen and the whim offer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p216-1","v":"y1v8","y":1,"o":10,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka yukimura-teruhiko ishizaki-daichi kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 9 half 1  flawless zazen and the whim offer the group s stated worry on final day  perfect in the dojo  then the van offer and the anchor leg  perfect posture beside him in zazen  in the van offers to relieve 1 2 km on a whim  is refused  and calls ayanokoji  cleverer than i thought  but also quite boring  walks out the moment the written exam ends  last on the relay by the representative s plan to motivate him  named as the unpredictable one the group still fears   now then  let s work up a light sweat  shall we   just a whim  a whim that can help you  not a bad offer  no   it seems you re cleverer than i thought  but also quite boring  flawless zazen posture  anchors the relay and finishes second without visible effort  only promised the minimum 1 2 km   would hold back beyond it  the responsibility question dodged","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p216-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.9 half 1: flawless zazen and the whim offer<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V8 · p.216–228<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">The group’s stated worry on final day; perfect in the dojo, then the van offer and the anchor leg.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"yukimura-teruhiko.html\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/a> · <a href=\"ishizaki-daichi.html\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Now then. Let’s work up a light sweat, shall we?”<span class=\"pg\">p.223<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“Just a whim. A whim that can help you. Not a bad offer, no?”<span class=\"pg\">p.223<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“It seems you’re cleverer than I thought. But also quite boring.”<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Perfect posture beside him in zazen; in the van offers to relieve 1.2 km on a whim, is refused, and calls Ayanokōji “cleverer than I thought. But also quite boring.”<span class=\"pg\">p.219, 223–224<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yukimura Teruhiko<\/b> Walks out the moment the written exam ends; last on the relay by the representative’s plan to motivate him.<span class=\"pg\">p.221, 223<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishizaki Daichi<\/b> Named as the unpredictable one the group still fears.<span class=\"pg\">p.216<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Flawless zazen posture; anchors the relay and finishes second without visible effort.<span class=\"pg\">p.219, 226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Limit<\/span> Only promised the minimum 1.2 km — would hold back beyond it; the responsibility question dodged.<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v8-p211-1\">← Before: Ch.7 closer<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v9-p20-1","v":"y1v9","y":1,"o":11,"k":"","w":"nagumo-miyabi kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke private points strategy named to the council sakayanagi raises a strategy she heard at the training camp  purchasing private points from about to graduate third years  topic came up during koenji and nagumo s conversation at the training camp   only the boys overheard  nagumo treats koenji as holding more points than the school permits   koenji seems to be the only one in possession of an amount greater than what the school permits after all  it s a form of rule violation  his plan exploits that private points are collected at graduation and worthless afterward  announcing it tipped the school off to a loophole that may be closed with a new rule  koenji does not appear in person  rows record how sakayanagi and nagumo discuss his strategy","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v9-p20-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Private-points strategy named to the council<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V9 · p.20–22<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Sakayanagi raises a strategy she heard at the training camp: purchasing private points from about-to-graduate third years.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Topic came up during Kōenji and Nagumo’s conversation at the training camp — only the boys overheard; Nagumo treats Kōenji as holding more points than the school permits.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> “Kōenji seems to be the only one in possession of an amount greater than what the school permits after all. It’s a form of rule violation.”<span class=\"pg\">p.21<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Rule<\/span> His plan exploits that private points are collected at graduation and worthless afterward; announcing it tipped the school off to a loophole that may be closed with a new rule.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Kōenji does not appear in person; rows record how Sakayanagi and Nagumo discuss his strategy.<span class=\"pg\">p.20–22<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p12-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 1  exam results koenji came second  his test results fluctuate  possibly slacking off when not worth his time","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p12-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1: Exam results<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.12–19<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kōenji came second; his test results fluctuate; possibly slacking off when not worth his time.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p30-1\">→ After: Ch.2: The Class Vote<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p30-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"spoken","w":"sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 2  the class vote koenji provokes sudo  claims unnecessary students should be removed   wrong  this special exam has its sights undoubtedly set upon the next two years  koenji claims hidden strength matters  he can do anything if he tries   if you want to know  it s because i am amazing  koenji argues students without ability should strive to turn over a new leaf  koenji ignored by sudo  horikita silences sudo  identified as a likely censure target by the ayanokoji group  keisei says koenji is an unnecessary student  easy to vote against  provokes sudo  argues unnecessary students should be removed","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p30-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.2: The Class Vote<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.30–84<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Kōenji provokes Sudō; claims unnecessary students should be removed. Kōenji claims hidden strength matters; he can do anything if he tries. Kōenji argues students without ability should strive to turn over a new leaf. Kōenji ignored by Sudō; Horikita silences Sudō. Identified as a likely censure target by the Ayanokōji Group. Keisei says Kōenji is an unnecessary student; easy to vote against.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“Wrong. This special exam has its sights undoubtedly set upon the next two years.”<span class=\"pg\">p.43<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“If you want to know, it’s because I am amazing.”<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Provokes Sudō; argues unnecessary students should be removed.<span class=\"pg\">p.42–48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p12-1\">← Before: Ch.1: Exam results<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p200-1\">→ After: Ch.5: Supporting Horikita’s nomination<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p200-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune yamauchi-haruki ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 5  supporting horikita s nomination encourages horikita to speak when she asks the class to stay  saying he has given up his time to hear her  remarks that trying to expel someone else to survive is natural in this exam and questions condemning yamauchi alone  presses yamauchi on why he targeted ayanokoji and calls it unpleasant that yamauchi colluded with class a  states that horikita s proposal is desirable and gives her his support   no objections here  i believe that horikita girl s proposal is quite desirable  we certainly don t want to keep around someone who could potentially betray the class  i certainly couldn t spend time with a student who could potentially betray the class  she has my support  supports her move to nominate yamauchi  questions and condemns him for colluding with class a  asks why yamauchi targeted him","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p200-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.5: Supporting Horikita’s nomination<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.200–215<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Encourages Horikita to speak when she asks the class to stay, saying he has given up his time to hear her. Remarks that trying to expel someone else to survive is natural in this exam and questions condemning Yamauchi alone. Presses Yamauchi on why he targeted Ayanokōji and calls it unpleasant that Yamauchi colluded with Class A. States that Horikita’s proposal is desirable and gives her his support.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“No objections here. I believe that Horikita-girl’s proposal is quite desirable. We certainly don’t want to keep around someone who could potentially betray the class. I certainly couldn’t spend time with a student who could…”<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “No objections here. I believe that Horikita-girl’s proposal is quite desirable. We certainly don’t want to keep around someone who could potentially betray the class. I certainly couldn’t spend time with a student who could potentially betray the class. She has my support.”<span class=\"pg\">p.215<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Supports her move to nominate Yamauchi.<span class=\"pg\">p.200, 215<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Questions and condemns him for colluding with Class A.<span class=\"pg\">p.209–215<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Asks why Yamauchi targeted him.<span class=\"pg\">p.210<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p30-1\">← Before: Ch.2: The Class Vote<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p299-1\">→ After: Epilogue: Provoking Yamauchi<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p299-1","v":"y1v10","y":1,"o":12,"k":"","w":"yamauchi-haruki hirata-yousuke ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke epilogue  provoking yamauchi tells yamauchi his defeat is close at hand before the results are announced  shows hirata a message indicating classmates were asked not to vote against him  questions yamauchi s claim that sakayanagi promised him 20 praise votes and points out a verbal promise is unreliable  casually stops yamauchi s chair attack and releases it when chabashira intervenes  tells ayanokoji he cooperated to avoid expulsion and denies provoking yamauchi out of concern for the class  provokes him before and after the results  shows him the message asking classmates not to vote against him  speaks with him after leaving the classroom","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p299-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Provoking Yamauchi<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V10 · p.299–312<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Tells Yamauchi his defeat is close at hand before the results are announced. Shows Hirata a message indicating classmates were asked not to vote against him. Questions Yamauchi’s claim that Sakayanagi promised him 20 praise votes and points out a verbal promise is unreliable. Casually stops Yamauchi’s chair attack and releases it when Chabashira intervenes. Tells Ayanokōji he cooperated to avoid expulsion and denies provoking Yamauchi out of concern for the class.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"yamauchi-haruki.html\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/a> · <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Yamauchi Haruki<\/b> Provokes him before and after the results.<span class=\"pg\">p.299–308<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Shows him the message asking classmates not to vote against him.<span class=\"pg\">p.300<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Speaks with him after leaving the classroom.<span class=\"pg\">p.311–312<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v10-p200-1\">← Before: Ch.5: Supporting Horikita’s nomination<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p55-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3  absent from class preparation does not return for the class c meeting after lunch  remains uninvolved after school  looking at his phone while classmates react to hirata s departure  is noted by him as someone who will not easily change","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p55-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3: Absent from class preparation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.55–58<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Does not return for the Class C meeting after lunch. Remains uninvolved after school, looking at his phone while classmates react to Hirata’s departure.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Is noted by him as someone who will not easily change.<span class=\"pg\">p.56<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p111-1\">→ After: Ch.4: Minimal participation<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p111-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4  minimal participation attends the after school discussion unexpectedly and says he is part of the class  says he wants the discussion wrapped up today and agrees to participate only this one time  declares there is nothing he cannot do when horikita asks for event ideas  refuses to pledge that he will win any event  saying he will decide for himself whether to use his talent for the class  remains unconcerned and focused on grooming himself during the morning turmoil in class  leaves before the next discussion  treating his single participation as sufficient  resists her attempts to secure his ongoing participation  provokes his irritation by his attitude and claims","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p111-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4: Minimal participation<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.111–139<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Attends the after-school discussion unexpectedly and says he is part of the class. Says he wants the discussion wrapped up today and agrees to participate only this one time. Declares there is nothing he cannot do when Horikita asks for event ideas. Refuses to pledge that he will win any event, saying he will decide for himself whether to use his talent for the class. Remains unconcerned and focused on grooming himself during the morning turmoil in class. Leaves before the next discussion, treating his single participation as sufficient.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Resists her attempts to secure his ongoing participation.<span class=\"pg\">p.111–122, 139<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Provokes his irritation by his attitude and claims.<span class=\"pg\">p.111, 123<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p55-1\">← Before: Ch.3: Absent from class preparation<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-1\">→ After: Ch.6: Intervening with Hirata and Mii-chan<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"hirata-yousuke wang-mei-yu ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6  intervening with hirata and mii chan comes across hirata and mii chan on the way home and provokes hirata by telling him to stop being an eyesore  suggests hirata leave the school if it is no longer ideal for him  restrains hirata by the wrist when hirata tries to grab him  criticizes hirata for ignoring mii chan and picks her up after hirata knocks her down again  carries mii chan toward the dormitory despite her protests  sets mii chan down at the dorm entrance and tells her to give up on chasing hirata for the day  tells ayanokoji he acted for his own reasons  calling hirata an eyesore  reminds ayanokoji that the commander can decide participation and asks not to be made to participate  provokes and restrains him during his confrontation with mii chan  helps her up and carries her away from hirata  speaks with him at the dormitory and comments on the commander s authority","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: Intervening with Hirata and Mii-chan<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.286–294<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Comes across Hirata and Mii-chan on the way home and provokes Hirata by telling him to stop being an eyesore. Suggests Hirata leave the school if it is no longer ideal for him. Restrains Hirata by the wrist when Hirata tries to grab him. Criticizes Hirata for ignoring Mii-chan and picks her up after Hirata knocks her down again. Carries Mii-chan toward the dormitory despite her protests. Sets Mii-chan down at the dorm entrance and tells her to give up on chasing Hirata for the day. Tells Ayanokōji he acted for his own reasons, calling Hirata an eyesore. Reminds Ayanokōji that the commander can decide participation and asks not to be made to participate.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Provokes and restrains him during his confrontation with Mii-chan.<span class=\"pg\">p.286–289<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> Helps her up and carries her away from Hirata.<span class=\"pg\">p.287–293<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Speaks with him at the dormitory and comments on the commander’s authority.<span class=\"pg\">p.293–294<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p111-1\">← Before: Ch.4: Minimal participation<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-2\">→ After: Ch.6: Intervening with Hirata<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-2","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"spoken","w":"hirata-yousuke wang-mei-yu kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 6  intervening with hirata provokes hirata on his way home   my my  it seems you re dawdling today as well  hmm  tells hirata he is an eyesore   you re an eyesore  so could you try and make sure you stay out of my sight  says he shows no mercy   i don t show mercy to those who come at me  okay  asks hirata if he still has complaints   do you still have complaints for me  says hirata s existence is like a fly   his existence is like a fly  that is  absolutely irritating  provokes and carries mii chan away  picks her up","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-2\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.6: Intervening with Hirata<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.286–293<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Provokes Hirata on his way home. Tells Hirata he is an eyesore. Says he shows no mercy. Asks Hirata if he still has complaints. Says Hirata’s existence is like a fly.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"hirata-yousuke.html\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/a> · <a href=\"wang-mei-yu.html\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">“My my. It seems you’re dawdling today as well, hmm?”<span class=\"pg\">p.286<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“You’re an eyesore, so could you try and make sure you stay out of my sight?”<span class=\"pg\">p.287<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">“I don’t show mercy to those who come at me, okay?”<span class=\"pg\">p.288<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “Do you still have complaints for me?”<span class=\"pg\">p.291<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> “His existence is like a fly, that is, absolutely irritating.”<span class=\"pg\">p.293<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Hirata Yōsuke<\/b> Provokes and carries Mii-chan away.<span class=\"pg\">p.286–293<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Wang Mei-Yu<\/b> Picks her up.<span class=\"pg\">p.289–292<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-1\">← Before: Ch.6: Intervening with Hirata and Mii-chan<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p359-1\">→ After: Ch.7: Flash Mental Arithmetic<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p359-1","v":"y1v11","y":1,"o":13,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka matsushita-chiaki kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 7  flash mental arithmetic is selected by ayanokoji for the flash mental arithmetic event alongside matsushita  folds his arms and closes his eyes during the event  leaving his answer sheet blank for the early questions  after the event  states the correct answer to the final question despite not having participated seriously  is chosen by him but does not cooperate in the event  competes alongside her in the event","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p359-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.7: Flash Mental Arithmetic<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y1V11 · p.359–364<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Is selected by Ayanokōji for the Flash Mental Arithmetic event alongside Matsushita. Folds his arms and closes his eyes during the event, leaving his answer sheet blank for the early questions. After the event, states the correct answer to the final question despite not having participated seriously.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"matsushita-chiaki.html\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Is chosen by him but does not cooperate in the event.<span class=\"pg\">p.359–364<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Matsushita Chiaki<\/b> Competes alongside her in the event.<span class=\"pg\">p.359–364<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y1v11-p286-2\">← Before: Ch.6: Intervening with Hirata<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v1-p221-1","v":"y2v1","y":2,"o":16,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke epilogue  refusing to cooperate refuses to find a partner  says he doesn t need to do anything  refuses her request","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v1-p221-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Epilogue: Refusing to cooperate<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V1 · p.221–224<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Refuses to find a partner. Says he doesn&#x27;t need to do anything.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Refuses her request.<span class=\"pg\">p.221–224<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v2-p329-1","v":"y2v2","y":2,"o":17,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji negotiates with horikita he approaches horikita before the exam and offers to get first place alone in exchange for  full freedom  until graduation  horikita counters with a condition   promise you full freedom  that s an unexpected proposal   i see  i see  certainly  you seem like you will be satisfied if i get 1st place by myself  riiight  confident and calculating   he negotiates for freedom but accepts horikita s condition  he negotiates with her","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v2-p329-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji negotiates with Horikita<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V2 · p.329–335<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">He approaches Horikita before the exam and offers to get first place alone in exchange for &quot;full freedom&quot; until graduation; Horikita counters with a condition.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Promise you full freedom… That&#x27;s an unexpected proposal.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.330<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I see, I see. Certainly, you seem like you will be satisfied if I get 1st place by myself, riiight?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.332<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Confident and calculating — he negotiates for freedom but accepts Horikita&#x27;s condition.<span class=\"pg\">p.329–335<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> He negotiates with her.<span class=\"pg\">p.329–335<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v3-p48-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"spoken","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji s reliability questioned horikita and ayanokoji discuss whether koenji will take the exam seriously  it s a coin flip   who knows  while he s agreed to my bet  there s no telling what he ll do  unpredictable   his participation is uncertain","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v3-p48-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji&#x27;s reliability questioned<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.48<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Horikita and Ayanokōji discuss whether Kōenji will take the exam seriously; it&#x27;s a coin flip.<\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Who knows… While he&#x27;s agreed to my bet, there&#x27;s no telling what he&#x27;ll do.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Unpredictable — his participation is uncertain.<span class=\"pg\">p.48<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v3-p221-1\">→ After: Kōenji&#x27;s dominance: Tug of War and swimming<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v3-p221-1","v":"y2v3","y":2,"o":18,"k":"spoken","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka nanase-tsubasa sakayanagi-arisu kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji s dominance  tug of war and swimming already at the c5 summit when ayanokoji arrives   traveled light with only a bottle of water  no tablet bag  pours water over himself  basking in his own  masculine beauty   ah  such a splendidly handsome man i am  these drops of masculine beauty trickling down my magnificent body   it seeeeems that my opponent is you  ayanokoji boy   fufu  so you re a man who thinks about things from the perspective of efficiency  hmmmm   you believe you have a chance to prevail over me is the fundamental reason you re having these wasteful thoughts   ayanokoji boy  quit overselling your worth inside that head of yours   to win at tug of war  one needs not these paltry parlor tricks  but raw  unbridled power  supreme confidence and physical prowess   sees through ayanokoji s efficiency thinking instantly  overpowers his calculated counter pull with raw strength  wins the tug of war  later dominates a swimming task too  takes the last spot at a harbor task  wins   powered up all the more since the year before  undefeated in strength stamina tasks across all three years   a strong  hard to control force moving alone  his first direct one on one opponent  reads him like an open book  his self talk baffles her  she notes his  surprisingly motivated  performance","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v3-p221-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji&#x27;s dominance: Tug of War and swimming<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V3 · p.221–237<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Already at the C5 summit when Ayanokōji arrives — traveled light with only a bottle of water, no tablet/bag; pours water over himself, basking in his own &quot;masculine beauty.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"nanase-tsubasa.html\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/a> · <a href=\"sakayanagi-arisu.html\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Ah… such a splendidly handsome man I am, these drops of masculine beauty trickling down my magnificent body.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;It seeeeems that my opponent is you, Ayanokōji-boy.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Fufu, so you&#x27;re a man who thinks about things from the perspective of efficiency, hmmmm?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.225<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;you believe you have a chance to prevail over me is the fundamental reason you&#x27;re having these wasteful thoughts.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Ayanokōji-boy, quit overselling your worth inside that head of yours.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;To win at Tug of War, one needs not these paltry parlor tricks, but raw, unbridled power.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.227<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Supreme confidence and physical prowess — sees through Ayanokōji&#x27;s efficiency-thinking instantly, overpowers his calculated counter-pull with raw strength, wins the Tug of War; later dominates a swimming Task too (takes the last spot at a harbor Task, wins, &quot;powered up all the more since the year before&quot;); undefeated in strength/stamina Tasks across all three years — a strong, hard-to-control force moving alone.<span class=\"pg\">p.221–237<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> His first direct one-on-one opponent; reads him like an open book.<span class=\"pg\">p.224–226<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nanase Tsubasa<\/b> His self-talk baffles her.<span class=\"pg\">p.224<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sakayanagi Arisu<\/b> She notes his &quot;surprisingly motivated&quot; performance.<span class=\"pg\">p.237<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v3-p48-1\">← Before: Kōenji&#x27;s reliability questioned<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4-p99-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"spoken","w":"kiriyama mikitani nagumo-miyabi kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji vs the third year  free groups  siege besieged on day eleven by kiriyama s group plus six  free groups   15 third years  mobilized by nagumo to stop his top streak  he s caught sleeping in broad daylight  from exhaustion   i m sure you will agree  i am a human being like you   take the day off  that s kind of funny   my physical strength has already recovered perfectly  i don t want you to talk about me as a normal person   i have a very short dream  i have an extremely low rem phase   i m not one to accept advice  kiriyama   i don t obey anyone   it is not a pretty situation  i don t like male sexuality   i have no intention of showing mercy to those who prevent me from moving forward   you are a real monster    mikitani  koenji breaks their spirits effortlessly evades the encirclement   reveals he has an extremely short rem sleep phase  recovering fully in naps  outruns the third years in a sprint  and when they physically try to block him  simply walks through them  as if a large rock was slowly crashing into him  making morooka fake a broken arm  breaks all 18 pursuers  fighting spirit without throwing a single punch  then leaves   kiriyama realizes that making the third years look like no big deal was exactly what koenji intended  recognizes him as one of only two  with nagumo  who can stop koenji  calmly analyzes his  super short sleep  the third year who confronts him  demands he stay put  and is humiliated when koenji walks through him  nagumo  behind the siege  was  very disappointed  at the failure","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4-p99-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji vs the third-year &quot;Free Groups&quot; siege<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.99–115<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Besieged on day eleven by Kiriyama&#x27;s group plus six &quot;Free Groups&quot; (15 third-years) mobilized by Nagumo to stop his top-stREAK; he&#x27;s caught sleeping in broad daylight (from exhaustion).<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"kiriyama.html\">Kiriyama<\/a> · <a href=\"index.html#mikitani\">Mikitani<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;m sure you will agree. I am a human being like you.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Take the day off? That&#x27;s kind of funny.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.104<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;My physical strength has already recovered perfectly. I don&#x27;t want you to talk about me as a normal person.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.104<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I have a very short dream. I have an extremely low REM phase.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.104<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I&#x27;m not one to accept advice, Kiriyama.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.106<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I don&#x27;t obey anyone.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It is not a pretty situation. I don&#x27;t like male sexuality.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.111<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I have no intention of showing mercy to those who prevent me from moving forward.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.112<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;You are a real monster.&quot; — Mikitani; Kōenji breaks their spirits<span class=\"pg\">p.114<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Effortlessly evades the encirclement — reveals he has an extremely short REM sleep phase (recovering fully in naps), outruns the third-years in a sprint, and when they physically try to block him, simply walks through them (&quot;as if a large rock was slowly crashing into him&quot;), making Morooka fake a broken arm; breaks all 18 pursuers&#x27; fighting spirit without throwing a single punch, then leaves — Kiriyama realizes that making the third-years look like no big deal was exactly what Kōenji intended.<span class=\"pg\">p.99–115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Kiriyama<\/b> Recognizes him as one of only two (with Nagumo) who can stop Kōenji; calmly analyzes his &quot;super short sleep.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.104–115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Mikitani<\/b> The third-year who confronts him, demands he stay put, and is humiliated when Kōenji walks through him.<span class=\"pg\">p.103–115<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Nagumo (behind the siege) was &quot;very disappointed&quot; at the failure.<span class=\"pg\">p.95–109<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4-p281-1\">→ After: Kōenji wins first place alone<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4-p281-1","v":"y2v4","y":2,"o":19,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune nagumo-miyabi kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji wins first place alone announced 1st place with 327 points  just 2 ahead of nagumo    the only group to win alone  hailed by all students   you really have done it  kouenji kun   i m sure you understand  right   yes  that s right  now let s go up again    do not say foolishness    horikita wins first alone under the harshest conditions  gaining 300 class points  1 million private points and a protection point  as promised he s granted immunity until graduation  do whatever he wanted  remains utterly self focused  already talking of ascending again  while horikita celebrates the 300 points toward reaching class a and warns him not to cause trouble this month  his class leader   their deal grants him freedom  she celebrates the class points but rebukes his  foolishness  beat him by 2 points","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4-p281-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji wins first place alone<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4 · p.281–282<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Announced 1st place with 327 points (just 2 ahead of Nagumo) — the only group to win alone, hailed by all students.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"nagumo-miyabi.html\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\"><b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> &quot;You really have done it, Kouenji-kun.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.281<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I&#x27;m sure you understand, right?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.281<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Yes, that&#x27;s right. Now let&#x27;s go up again.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.282<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;... Do not say foolishness.&quot; — Horikita<span class=\"pg\">p.282<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Wins first alone under the harshest conditions, gaining 300 class points, 1 million private points and a Protection Point; as promised he&#x27;s granted immunity until graduation (&quot;do whatever he wanted&quot;); remains utterly self-focused, already talking of ascending again, while Horikita celebrates the 300 points toward reaching Class A and warns him not to cause trouble this month.<span class=\"pg\">p.281–282<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> His class leader — their deal grants him freedom; she celebrates the class points but rebukes his &quot;foolishness.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.281–282<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Nagumo Miyabi<\/b> Beat him by 2 points.<span class=\"pg\">p.281<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4-p99-1\">← Before: Kōenji vs the third-year &quot;Free Groups&quot; siege<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4_5-p10-1","v":"y2v4.5","y":2,"o":20,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke kouenji rokusuke mentioned in passing named in this volume  passing mentions on pages  p 13  p 37  p 45  p 48 49  p 87 88  passing mention only","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v4_5-p10-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">kouenji-rokusuke mentioned in passing<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V4.5 · p.10-290<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Named in this volume.<\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>2 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> Passing mentions on pages: p.13, p.37, p.45, p.48-49, p.87-88.<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Mentioned<\/span> Passing mention only.<span class=\"pg\">p.10<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v5-p7-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v5-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.7-243<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v5-p103-1\">→ After: Kōenji votes to expel; makes a deal with Horikita<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v5-p103-1","v":"y2v5","y":2,"o":21,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune sudou-ken ishigami-kyou kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji votes to expel  makes a deal with horikita breaks his silence on q3  backing keisei s protection point plan because he wants horikita to  work harder   for the amount of protection points we give up  we can have the horikita girl work harder than anyone else   very well  it s getting interesting in this special exam  this is quite enjoyable   you ll get 100 more class points  right  that means you ll inevitably get more private points every month   friends  i ve never thought of any of you as my friends   class points are not important   it s not impossible to raise the price  but i need the horikita girl to be a reliable ally  deliberately provocative   votes  in favour  of expelling a classmate twice  for the private points  to replace what he lost in q3  openly declares the class aren t his friends  and enjoys the chaos  but it was a calculated performance to sell his vote   he accepts horikita s deal  10 000 private points month until graduation  and switches to  against  having wanted  the horikita girl to be a reliable ally  all along  openly provokes her but makes a private deal to switch his vote  calls her  horikita girl  needles him mercilessly  red hair kun  they trade barbs about who contributes more  backs his protection point argument on q3","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v5-p103-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji votes to expel; makes a deal with Horikita<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V5 · p.103–120<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Breaks his silence on Q3, backing Keisei&#x27;s protection-point plan because he wants Horikita to &quot;work harder.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a> · <a href=\"ishigami-kyou.html\">Ishigami Kyō<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;For the amount of protection points we give up, we can have the Horikita girl work harder than anyone else.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.103<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Very well, it&#x27;s getting interesting in this special exam. This is quite enjoyable.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You&#x27;ll get 100 more class points, right? That means you&#x27;ll inevitably get more private points every month.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>7 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Friends? I&#x27;ve never thought of any of you as my friends.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Class points are not important.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;It&#x27;s not impossible to raise the price, but I need the Horikita girl to be a reliable ally.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.119<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Deliberately provocative — votes &quot;in favour&quot; of expelling a classmate twice (for the private points, to replace what he lost in Q3), openly declares the class aren&#x27;t his friends, and enjoys the chaos; but it was a calculated performance to sell his vote — he accepts Horikita&#x27;s deal (10,000 private points/month until graduation) and switches to &quot;against,&quot; having wanted &quot;the Horikita girl to be a reliable ally&quot; all along.<span class=\"pg\">p.103–120<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Openly provokes her but makes a private deal to switch his vote; calls her &quot;Horikita girl.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.113–120<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Needles him mercilessly (&quot;Red Hair-kun&quot;); they trade barbs about who contributes more.<span class=\"pg\">p.113–119<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ishigami Kyō<\/b> Backs his protection-point argument on Q3.<span class=\"pg\">p.100–103<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v5-p7-1\">← Before: Full volume<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v6-p11-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v6-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.11-346<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v6-p44-1\">→ After: Kōenji: conditional trust, calculated freedom<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v6-p44-1","v":"y2v6","y":2,"o":22,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji  conditional trust  calculated freedom  you are a very lucky girl  it looks like   i made a bit of money in the uninhabited island test and the treasure hunt  but at this time i need quite some money to spend   there s nothing the other classes have for me at this point that beats the agreement i have with you  ms  horikita   i had it all figured out  if the turn of events would have led to me becoming a candidate for expulsion  i would ve voted against the motion before that step   i would never trust someone else with my life  neither would you  isn t that so  agrees to compete in the sports festival for the cash prizes  and confirms  for now  he won t change classes  reveals he never fully trusted horikita   if he d been nominated for expulsion he d have voted himself against   and that his  trust  was conditional on self preservation  ayanokoji notes he s  carefree  yet deeply calculating   the one student he can never figure out  their agreement keeps him in class   for now  he d have defended himself if needed  he sees through his eavesdropping and they trade masked insights","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v6-p44-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji: conditional trust, calculated freedom<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V6 · p.44–47<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You are a very lucky girl, it looks like.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I made a bit of money in the Uninhabited Island Test and the treasure hunt, but at this time I need quite some money to spend.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.45<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There&#x27;s nothing the other classes have for me at this point that beats the agreement I have with you, Ms. Horikita.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.46<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>5 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I had it all figured out. If the turn of events would have led to me becoming a candidate for expulsion, I would&#x27;ve voted against the motion before that step.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I would never trust someone else with my life. Neither would you, isn&#x27;t that so?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Agrees to compete in the sports festival for the cash prizes, and confirms (for now) he won&#x27;t change classes; reveals he never fully trusted Horikita — if he&#x27;d been nominated for expulsion he&#x27;d have voted himself against — and that his &quot;trust&quot; was conditional on self-preservation; Ayanokōji notes he&#x27;s &quot;carefree&quot; yet deeply calculating — the one student he can never figure out.<span class=\"pg\">p.44–47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Their agreement keeps him in class — for now; he&#x27;d have defended himself if needed.<span class=\"pg\">p.45–47<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> He sees through his eavesdropping and they trade masked insights.<span class=\"pg\">p.47<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v6-p11-1\">← Before: Full volume<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v7-p7-1","v":"y2v7","y":2,"o":23,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v7-p7-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V7 · p.7-207<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v8-p11-1","v":"y2v8","y":2,"o":24,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v8-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V8 · p.11-208<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9-p177-1","v":"y2v9","y":2,"o":25,"k":"","w":"horikita-suzune kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji  the unpredictable last solver in the exam on the morning of the special exam he is  as usual  utterly relaxed   browsing the internet with a hand mirror while others study hard  horikita  unsure whether he will take it seriously  places him last in the order so that 98 of 100 questions are already filled in before his turn  he replies only that he has the right to do whatever he wants  free and unpredictable   his refusal to commit to seriousness forces horikita to design the order around him  giving him the final  safest slot  she works around his unpredictability by putting him last","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v9-p177-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji: the unpredictable last solver in the exam<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V9 · p.177–180<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">On the morning of the special exam he is, as usual, utterly relaxed — browsing the internet with a hand mirror while others study hard; Horikita, unsure whether he will take it seriously, places him last in the order so that 98 of 100 questions are already filled in before his turn.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>3 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Caveat<\/span> He replies only that he has the right to do whatever he wants.<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Free and unpredictable — his refusal to commit to seriousness forces Horikita to design the order around him, giving him the final, safest slot.<span class=\"pg\">p.177–180<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> She works around his unpredictability by putting him last.<span class=\"pg\">p.178<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v10-p9-1","v":"y2v10","y":2,"o":28,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v10-p9-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V10 · p.9-235<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v11-p11-1","v":"y2v11","y":2,"o":30,"k":"","w":"kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke full volume appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v11-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Full volume<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V11 · p.11-223<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears in this volume.<\/p><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v12_5-p11-1","v":"y2v12.5","y":2,"o":32,"k":"","w":"ayanokouji-kiyotaka kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 1 mentioned appears in ch 1  appears in this volume","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y2v12_5-p11-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.1<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y2V12.5 · p.11-23<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Mentioned/appears in Ch.1.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a><\/p><details class=\"more\"><summary>1 more note<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Appears in this volume.<span class=\"pg\">p.11-23<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v2-p66-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune ayanokouji-kiyotaka sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 3   depth read  koenji rejects and then sells his discipline walks out of class a s discussion  horikita chases him into the hallway   well  well  horikita girl  is there something i can do for you   i don t mind listening a bit  as long as we re walking   wouldn t that simply be pointless  my time is quite priceless  you see   if the class falls apart simply because i ve left  that just goes to show the limits of your own abilities  horikita girl   being in class a is proof of unity  the only reason the class was lucky enough to win was because ayanokouji boy was making his moves   are you planning to make an enemy of me too  horikita girl   for one week  starting tomorrow i shall sell you my discipline  for the exceptional price of 500 000 private points  arrogant  blunt and self assured  sees through horikita s carrot and threat tactics and warns her with rare killing intent  recognizes independently that the exam is about discipline  70  and doubles her offer to 500 000 points  rebuffs her in the hallway  then accepts a secret 500 000 point deal for one week of good behavior  credits his moves  not class unity  for class a s wins  calls him  red hair kun  claims he is the first man in his room","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v2-p66-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.3 — depth read: Kōenji rejects and then sells his discipline<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.66–125<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Walks out of Class A&#x27;s discussion; Horikita chases him into the hallway.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"ayanokouji-kiyotaka.html\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Well, well, Horikita Girl. Is there something I can do for you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I don&#x27;t mind listening a bit, as long as we&#x27;re walking.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.70<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Wouldn&#x27;t that simply be pointless? My time is quite priceless, you see.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;If the class falls apart simply because I&#x27;ve left, that just goes to show the limits of your own abilities, Horikita Girl.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.71<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Being in Class A is proof of unity? The only reason the class was lucky enough to win was because Ayanokouji-boy was making his moves.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Are you planning to make an enemy of me too, Horikita-girl?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;For one week, starting tomorrow—I shall sell you my discipline. For the exceptional price of 500,000 Private Points.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Arrogant, blunt and self-assured; sees through Horikita&#x27;s carrot-and-threat tactics and warns her with rare killing intent.<span class=\"pg\">p.70–74<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Recognizes independently that the exam is about discipline (~70%) and doubles her offer to 500,000 points.<span class=\"pg\">p.121–122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Rebuffs her in the hallway, then accepts a secret 500,000-point deal for one week of good behavior.<span class=\"pg\">p.69–123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Ayanokōji Kiyotaka<\/b> Credits his moves, not class unity, for Class A&#x27;s wins.<span class=\"pg\">p.72<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Calls him &quot;red-hair-kun&quot;; claims he is the first man in his room.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v2-p120-1\">→ After: Kōenji&#x27;s deal: selling his discipline for 500,000<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v2-p120-1","v":"y3v2","y":3,"o":34,"k":"spoken","w":"horikita-suzune sudou-ken kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke koenji s deal  selling his discipline for 500 000 opens his door late at night to horikita and sudo  welcomes them in when he hears  special exam   oh my  oh my  to think the fools at my door were none other than my own classmates   if you wished to make an appointment with me  i should think you would have used your cell phone   i wondered what this request could be  but are you still not giving up  horikita girl   fufufu  you should be purely delighted  red hair kun  you are the first man to have ever set foot in my room   coincidentally  that is precisely what i was thinking  myself   most likely the same way you did  from our teacher s attitude   there is nothing more expensive than something free  you know   for one week  starting tomorrow i shall sell you my discipline  for the exceptional price of 500 000 private points   even this is me showing considerable kindness  you know   of course  it will be a sad time from tomorrow  not being able to take in the sight of my beautiful  long legs upon my desk  arrogant  theatrical and sharp   had deduced the discipline exam himself from chabashira s attitude  demands payment even if his compliance proves irrelevant  and doubles her offer after seeing through her bluff about the upper limit  negotiates with her  calls her  horikita girl  sees through her 200 000 point ceiling  and strikes the 500 000 point deal  calls him  red hair kun  and  the first man  in his room","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v2-p120-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Kōenji&#x27;s deal: selling his discipline for 500,000<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V2 · p.120–124<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Opens his door late at night to Horikita and Sudō; welcomes them in when he hears &quot;special exam.&quot;<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"horikita-suzune.html\">Horikita Suzune<\/a> · <a href=\"sudou-ken.html\">Sudō Ken<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;Oh my, oh my. To think the fools at my door were none other than my own classmates.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;If you wished to make an appointment with me, I should think you would have used your cell phone.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I wondered what this request could be, but are you still not giving up, Horikita-girl?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.120<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>10 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Fufufu. You should be purely delighted, red-hair-kun. You are the first man to have ever set foot in my room.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Coincidentally, that is precisely what I was thinking, myself.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Most likely the same way you did. From our teacher&#x27;s attitude.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;There is nothing more expensive than something free, you know.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;For one week, starting tomorrow—I shall sell you my discipline. For the exceptional price of 500,000 Private Points.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Even this is me showing considerable kindness, you know?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.122<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Of course. It will be a sad time from tomorrow, not being able to take in the sight of my beautiful, long legs upon my desk.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.123<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Arrogant, theatrical and sharp — had deduced the discipline exam himself from Chabashira&#x27;s attitude, demands payment even if his compliance proves irrelevant, and doubles her offer after seeing through her bluff about the upper limit.<span class=\"pg\">p.120–124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Horikita Suzune<\/b> Negotiates with her; calls her &quot;Horikita-girl,&quot; sees through her 200,000-point ceiling, and strikes the 500,000-point deal.<span class=\"pg\">p.120–124<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Sudō Ken<\/b> Calls him &quot;red-hair-kun&quot; and &quot;the first man&quot; in his room.<span class=\"pg\">p.121<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v2-p66-1\">← Before: Ch.3 — depth read: Kōenji rejects and then sells his discipline<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p119-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"morofuji-rika komiya-kyogo kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke ch 4   depth read  koenji s casual massacre ambushes class b s e9 supply group from the forest with unseen  precise shots   you re the vip  aren t you  if you were to fight back  you would simply be eliminated for nothing   there is nothing to it  is there  i am from class a  you are from class b  we re enemies   i enjoyed the uninhabited island for a day and thinking i had my fill  was on my way back to the ship but i thought i d give this a try for the novelty of it   for me  winning or losing this special exam is a matter of supreme indifference   very well  i shall take my leave now  i trust you will take care not to get in my way again  eliminates six of class b s eight guards in under thirty seconds without being seen  then spares vip morofuji and lets her keep the supplies  detached and theatrical   fights purely for amusement  indifferent to winning  yet his  kindness   sparing morofuji  doubles as a stern warning  spares her and lets her take the supplies  is baited by his shouting  which reveals their position  takes him out first","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p119-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Ch.4 — depth read: Kōenji&#x27;s casual massacre<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.119–150<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Ambushes Class B&#x27;s E9 supply group from the forest with unseen, precise shots.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"morofuji-rika.html\">Morofuji Rika<\/a> · <a href=\"komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You&#x27;re the VIP, aren&#x27;t you? If you were to fight back, you would simply be eliminated for nothing.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There is nothing to it, is there? I am from Class A, you are from Class B. We&#x27;re enemies.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;I enjoyed the uninhabited island for a day and thinking I had my fill, was on my way back to the ship—but I thought I&#x27;d give this a try for the novelty of it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>6 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;For me, winning or losing this special exam is a matter of supreme indifference.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Very well. I shall take my leave now. I trust you will take care not to get in my way again.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Eliminates six of Class B&#x27;s eight guards in under thirty seconds without being seen, then spares VIP Morofuji and lets her keep the supplies.<span class=\"pg\">p.130–134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Detached and theatrical — fights purely for amusement, indifferent to winning, yet his &quot;kindness&quot; (sparing Morofuji) doubles as a stern warning.<span class=\"pg\">p.133–134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Morofuji Rika<\/b> Spares her and lets her take the supplies.<span class=\"pg\">p.133–134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> Is baited by his shouting, which reveals their position; takes him out first.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–133<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p128-1\">→ After: The unseen ambush on Class B&#x27;s supply group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p128-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"morofuji-rika komiya-kyogo kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke the unseen ambush on class b s supply group appears walking with a confident stride after eliminating class b s guards from unseen positions in the forest   you re the vip  aren t you  if you were to fight back  you would simply be eliminated for nothing   there is nothing to it  is there  i am from class a  you are from class b  we re enemies   my  my  i had no knowledge that i would stumble upon you  however  when one hears voices and gunshots so unsuited for this great wilderness  it is something one would understand whether one likes it or not   i enjoyed the uninhabited island for a day and thinking i had my fill  was on my way back to the ship but i thought i d give this a try for the novelty of it   is that so  in that case  you may take the supplies and return with them to class b   for me  winning or losing this special exam is a matter of supreme indifference   very well  i shall take my leave now  i trust you will take care not to get in my way again  eliminates six of class b s guards in under thirty seconds with unseen  precise shots  then appears and takes out the last two   all eight guards around vip morofuji down without ever being located  detached  theatrical and bored   fought purely for novelty  indifferent to winning  and let morofuji keep the supplies  his  kindness  doubles as a stern warning  he located the group by following komiya s loud provoking shouts and gunfire  which were quite unsuited for the great wilderness  spares her and lets her take the supplies despite her aiming a dropped weapon at him  komiya s bragging and shotgun blasts give away their position  koenji takes him out first","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p128-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">The unseen ambush on Class B&#x27;s supply group<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.128–134<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears walking with a confident stride after eliminating Class B&#x27;s guards from unseen positions in the forest.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"morofuji-rika.html\">Morofuji Rika<\/a> · <a href=\"komiya-kyogo.html\">Komiya Kyogo<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You&#x27;re the VIP, aren&#x27;t you? If you were to fight back, you would simply be eliminated for nothing.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There is nothing to it, is there? I am from Class A, you are from Class B. We&#x27;re enemies.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;My, my. I had no knowledge that I would stumble upon you. However, when one hears voices and gunshots so unsuited for this great wilderness, it is something one would understand whether one likes it or not.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>9 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;I enjoyed the uninhabited island for a day and thinking I had my fill, was on my way back to the ship—but I thought I&#x27;d give this a try for the novelty of it.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Is that so? In that case, you may take the supplies and return with them to Class B.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;For me, winning or losing this special exam is a matter of supreme indifference.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Spoken<\/span> &quot;Very well. I shall take my leave now. I trust you will take care not to get in my way again.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Eliminates six of Class B&#x27;s guards in under thirty seconds with unseen, precise shots, then appears and takes out the last two — all eight guards around VIP Morofuji down without ever being located.<span class=\"pg\">p.130–133<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Detached, theatrical and bored — fought purely for novelty, indifferent to winning, and let Morofuji keep the supplies; his &quot;kindness&quot; doubles as a stern warning.<span class=\"pg\">p.133–134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Inference, not stated<\/span> He located the group by following Komiya&#x27;s loud provoking shouts and gunfire, which were quite unsuited for the great wilderness.<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Morofuji Rika<\/b> Spares her and lets her take the supplies despite her aiming a dropped weapon at him.<span class=\"pg\">p.133–134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Komiya Kyogo<\/b> Komiya&#x27;s bragging and shotgun blasts give away their position; Koenji takes him out first.<span class=\"pg\">p.128–133<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p119-1\">← Before: Ch.4 — depth read: Kōenji&#x27;s casual massacre<\/button><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p131-1\">→ After: Depth review: the unreachable lone wolf<\/button><\/div><\/article>"},{"i":"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p131-1","v":"y3v3","y":3,"o":35,"k":"spoken","w":"morofuji-rika kouenji-rokusuke","q":"koenji rokusuke depth review  the unreachable lone wolf appears unseen and eliminates eight class b guards around morofuji in under thirty seconds   you re the vip  aren t you   there is nothing to it  is there  i am from class a  you are from class b  we re enemies   for me  winning or losing this special exam is a matter of supreme indifference  single handedly dismantles a class b guard unit with precise  unseen fire  spares vip morofuji and lets her keep the supplies  courtly  theatrical and self assured    my  my  and grand pronouncements about the  great wilderness  acts purely for his own amusement  true to his word that winning or losing is a matter of indifference to him  spares her with a warning dressed as kindness","h":"<article class=\"card\" id=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p131-1\"><h3><span class=\"ttl\">Depth review: the unreachable lone wolf<\/span><span class=\"meta\">Y3V3 · p.131–134<\/span><\/h3><p class=\"setup\">Appears unseen and eliminates eight Class B guards around Morofuji in under thirty seconds.<\/p><p class=\"with\">with <a href=\"morofuji-rika.html\">Morofuji Rika<\/a><\/p><ul class=\"lines\"><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;You&#x27;re the VIP, aren&#x27;t you?&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;There is nothing to it, is there? I am from Class A, you are from Class B. We&#x27;re enemies.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li class=\"q spoken\">&quot;For me, winning or losing this special exam is a matter of supreme indifference.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><\/ul><details class=\"more\"><summary>4 more notes<\/summary><ul class=\"rows\"><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Feat<\/span> Single-handedly dismantles a Class B guard unit with precise, unseen fire; spares VIP Morofuji and lets her keep the supplies.<span class=\"pg\">p.131<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Voice<\/span> Courtly, theatrical and self-assured — &quot;My, my...&quot; and grand pronouncements about the &quot;great wilderness.&quot;<span class=\"pg\">p.133<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Trait<\/span> Acts purely for his own amusement; true to his word that winning or losing is a matter of indifference to him.<span class=\"pg\">p.134<\/span><\/li><li><span class=\"mlabel\">Relationship<\/span> <b class=\"sp\">Morofuji Rika<\/b> Spares her with a warning dressed as kindness.<span class=\"pg\">p.131–134<\/span><\/li><\/ul><\/details><div class=\"ptrs\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"ptr\" data-go=\"sc-kouenji-rokusuke-y3v3-p128-1\">← Before: The unseen ambush on Class B&#x27;s supply group<\/button><\/div><\/article>"}];
